{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "curve", "line": "But I’m far from pussy, so you know I do not care (I don’t care)", "vault_lines": ["Fuck her by the pool, yeah"], "meaning": "Here, “pussy” means coward/weak person, not anything sexual. He’s basically saying “I’m not a coward, so I’m not going to let this fear control me.”", "annotation_id": "41143849", "url": "https://genius.com/41143849", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
