{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "ZE$TY BOYZ", "line": "I feel like Rick James steppin’ on your couch", "vault_lines": ["I feel like Rick James steppin' on your couch"], "meaning": "Uzi feels like he’s earned the right to be stuntin' and stepping on other people’s couches in clubs.\n\nOn The Dave Chapelle Show Charlie Murphy recalls a time Rick James said “Fuck Yo Couch” at a party. View the entire video here.", "annotation_id": "9222574", "url": "https://genius.com/9222574", "state": "accepted", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
