{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "You’re The One (Scarecrow)", "line": "I am a real demon, how could you put your trust in me?", "vault_lines": ["I am a real demon, how could you put your trust in me?"], "meaning": "Uzi displays self-awareness about his own toxicity and destructive tendencies. By labeling himself a “real demon,” he warns his partner that he will inevitably break her trust, questioning her judgment for placing faith in someone who openly embraces his dark, chaotic nature.", "annotation_id": "41422863", "url": "https://genius.com/41422863", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "You’re The One (Scarecrow)", "line": "My pockets all blue them bitches coolin’", "vault_lines": ["My pockets all blue them bitches coolin'"], "meaning": "Uzi only stacks 100 dollar bills in his wallet.", "annotation_id": "41422854", "url": "https://genius.com/41422854", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "You’re The One (Scarecrow)", "line": "I just ignore all the pain and get guap (Guap)", "vault_lines": ["I just ignore all the pain and get guap (Guap)"], "meaning": "Uzi uses wealth accumulation as a shield, choosing to suppress his emotional pain by obsessively chasing money.", "annotation_id": "41422852", "url": "https://genius.com/41422852", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "You’re The One (Scarecrow)", "line": "I can just feel riddance, this curse is stuck with me", "vault_lines": ["I can just feel riddance, this curse is stuck with me"], "meaning": "Uzi touches on the price of wealth and fame. He feels cursed by his lifestyle, unable to find genuine relationships or shake off the negative energy and fake people surrounding him.", "annotation_id": "41422844", "url": "https://genius.com/41422844", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "You’re The One (Scarecrow)", "line": "I know we can pop out, but will you go all in the cut with me?", "vault_lines": ["I know we can pop out, but will you go all in the cut with me?"], "meaning": "Uzi acknowledges this girl is ready to step out and enjoy a lavish, high-profile lifestyle. However, he questions whether she’s equally committed to standing by him in low-key, high-risk environments, both physically and mentally.", "annotation_id": "41422805", "url": "https://genius.com/41422805", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "You’re The One (Scarecrow)", "line": "No, she do not use her tooth, been VVS all on my jewels", "vault_lines": ["No, she do not use her tooth, been VVS all on my jewels"], "meaning": "VVS are the highest quality jewels in terms of clarity, color, size, etc. Uzi does not wear fake jewels nor low quality ones.", "annotation_id": "41422804", "url": "https://genius.com/41422804", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "You’re The One (Scarecrow)", "line": "But back to my windows, them shits 5%, keep the tool in it (Bah)", "vault_lines": ["But back to my windows, them shits 5%, keep the tool in it (Bah)"], "meaning": "Uzi is so well known that he needs lethal protection and to hide his identity behind near-black windows.", "annotation_id": "41422800", "url": "https://genius.com/41422800", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "You’re The One (Scarecrow)", "line": "These sucker ass niggas be rats and they talk to the lieutenant (Ew)", "vault_lines": ["These sucker ass niggas be rats and they talk to the lieutenant (Ew)"], "meaning": "They are snitches, aka rats, and they talk to high ranking police officers aka lieutenants. This is a major violation of street code.", "annotation_id": "41422796", "url": "https://genius.com/41422796", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "You’re The One (Scarecrow)", "line": "They all birds to me and I’m that scarecrow", "vault_lines": ["They all birds to me and I'm that scarecrow ('Crow)"], "meaning": "Uzi uses the scarecrow metaphor to show how he guards his money and status from shallow, predatory groupies.\n\nThis also serves as a double entendre referencing his ex-girlfriend Brittany Byrd. Uzi plays on her last name to emphasize that she’s now just another “bird” he needs to keep away.", "annotation_id": "41422777", "url": "https://genius.com/41422777", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
