{"type": "song", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Young & Famous", "status": "done", "targets": 0, "clicked": 0, "genius_url": "https://genius.com/3d-friends-young-and-famous-lyrics", "genius_title": "Young & Famous", "genius_id": 10995804, "source": "api"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "You Was Right", "line": "(If Young Metro don’t trust you, I’m gon’ shoot you)", "vault_lines": ["Hit it from the back, watch a nigga bless you (Bless you)"], "meaning": "“If Young Metro don’t trust you” is Metro Boomin’s producer tag-line, as he produced this track. The sample is voiced by Future, and is originally from Uncle Murda’s “Right Now.”\n\n“Metro Boomin' want some more” is another one of Metro’s tag-lines, this one is voiced by Young Thug, and was originally from Thug’s song “Some More.”", "annotation_id": "9237118", "url": "https://genius.com/9237118", "state": "accepted", "votes": 87, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "You Was Right", "line": "Try to diss me, I’ll take it to your family (Yeah) I’ll fuck your sister, then make sure that she vanish, yeah", "vault_lines": ["Try to diss me, I'll take it to your family (Yeah)"], "meaning": "If you ever try to come at Lil Uzi he will hit you where it hurts the most. There are the lucky few that do not get this severe treatment, such as this hacker.\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kSby73d4GNc", "annotation_id": "9014546", "url": "https://genius.com/9014546", "state": "accepted", "votes": 77, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "You Was Right", "line": "Yeah, looked at my mama just like, we rich (Yeah) Looked at my bitch like, we rich Said, we ain’t got no minor setbacks (No)", "vault_lines": ["Yeah, looked at my mama just like, we rich (Yeah)"], "meaning": "All Uzi wants to do is celebrate his success with his girlfriend, even if it can’t solve their relationship problems.\n\nIn an interview with Sway, Uzi said that he loves sharing his riches with his girlfriend, Brittany—Now there’s nothing more that can hold them back from more success!\n\nBut, as he said in “Scott and Ramona,” Uzi doesn’t forget where he came from:\n\nI went to my hood all my friends think I made it\nI talk to my fam, man my momma think I’m famous", "annotation_id": "9014481", "url": "https://genius.com/9014481", "state": "accepted", "votes": 36, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "You Was Right", "line": "When I, when I saw my girl, yeah, you know I had to bag that (Yeah) And before me, four niggas, yeah, they had that Five niggas includin’ me, I had to back back", "vault_lines": ["When I, when I saw my girl, yeah, you know I had to bag that (Yeah)"], "meaning": "It was love at first sight for Uzi and his girlfriend  Brittany, a fashion designer from LA. All four of her previous boyfriends are no match for Lil Uzi!\n\nIn the comic book Scott Pilgrim Vs. The World—which this project is heavily based off—Scott Pilgrim has a very similar problem with his girlfriend Ramona’s ex-boyfriends. Uzi expands on this in “Scott and Ramona,” which pays homage to the comics.", "annotation_id": "9014238", "url": "https://genius.com/9014238", "state": "accepted", "votes": 43, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "You Was Right", "line": "Even though we in the same room (Shh) You just locked the door, so I gotta text you (Yeah, yeah) Like, bae, unlock the door, I gotta use the restroom Like, I don’t want a war, I wanna caress you, yeah (Yeah)", "vault_lines": ["Even though we in the same room (Shh)"], "meaning": "As their argument continues, physical and emotional barriers are put up between Uzi and his girlfriend. She won’t listen to him verbally anymore. Again, he expresses his desire for their disagreement to be over so he can physically show his love.", "annotation_id": "9010425", "url": "https://genius.com/9010425", "state": "accepted", "votes": 95, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "You Was Right", "line": "Hit it from the back, watch a nigga bless you (Bless you)", "vault_lines": ["Hit it from the back, watch a nigga bless you (Bless you)"], "meaning": "Uzi’s arguing with his girlfriend over his unfaithfulness, after he had sex with a groupie. Even though he admits his mistakes to try and save their relationship, words can’t take that back.\n\nAs a last resort, Uzi suggests that having great sex with him will remind her why she loves him—After all, Lil Uzi can’t go a day without talking to his baby.\n\n\n\nThe “fantasy” on his phone is pictures of his girlfriend, meaning that instead of having sex with the groupie, he should’ve looked at the pictures and remembered why he loves her.", "annotation_id": "9003026", "url": "https://genius.com/9003026", "state": "accepted", "votes": 301, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "You Was Right", "line": "Countin’ all that money, told that nigga just to bet that I, I know that you ain’t got it, boy, why you ain’t just say that? (Yeah) They see I got that money, now his bitch like, “I said that” (Yeah) I don’t pay that ho no mind, I’ve been had that", "vault_lines": ["Countin' all that money, told that nigga just to bet that"], "meaning": "Unlike his haters, Uzi really owns the money that he shows off. His grind and come up have provided him with a steady income.\n\n\n\nAlong with the cash, Uzi has taken a hater’s girlfriend, who he quickly sets aside, as she’s nothing new to him.", "annotation_id": "9001808", "url": "https://genius.com/9001808", "state": "accepted", "votes": 30, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
