{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "You Don’t Even Know", "line": "You don’t even know what I went through Girl left a lil’ nigga straight for a 6'2\" (Huh?)", "vault_lines": ["You don't even know what I went through"], "meaning": "This line is directed at another fellow rapper, Saint Jhn (6'2), who Lil Uzi Vert’s ex girlfriend, Brittany Byrd, was alleged to be seeing and potentially dating in 2020. It was reported that Lil Uzi Vert had attacked the pair, possibly from jealousy, and still feels heartbroken over the situation.\n\nBrittany Byrd has been mentioned frequently, and has collaborated with Lil Uzi Vert in skits in earlier projects, most notably his hit song, “7 AM”.", "annotation_id": "37403885", "url": "https://genius.com/37403885", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "You Don’t Even Know", "line": "You don’t even know what I’m goin’ through Yeah, I went diamond but they still owe me three checks", "vault_lines": ["You don't even know what I went through"], "meaning": "Uzi speaks about how he has been awarded a RIAA Diamond Certification on his hit single “XO TOUR Llif3” but his two labels Generation now and Atlantic Records still owe him for it.\n\nThis is not the first time Uzi has spoken about the situation with Atlantic and Generation Now, stemming back to late 2016, when he was rolling out Luv Is Rage 2, taking to X (Formerly Twitter) he would state:\n\nCan I honestly tell y'all why this album ain’t drop ….2®\n\nFollowed by another tweet:\n\nIt’s because of a Old Person who doesn’t Understand what’s going on right now…. Can You Guess Who?\n\nPresumably pointing a pretty prominent finger at DJ Drama, the co-founder of Generation Now. But later on an episode of The Joe Budden Podcast an Atlantic Records executive, Michael Kyser would say that the reason the album didn’t release in 2016 is quote on quote because:\n\nHe’s doing 50 million streams a week. Why do I need to put an album out?\n\nLuv Is Rage 2 would finally see it’s release on August 25, 2017. This however wouldn’t be the end of the drama between the two, in January 2018 Uzi would again take to X to express his feelings, stating:\n\nAnd if y’all do sign … sign 2 a major Dont sign 2 a rapper or a Dj ……..Its Just Easier When The Time Come For That Fake Shit 🙄💯®️\n\nThis tweet would get a reply from DJ Drama himself, telling Uzi to state the facts and see who is really “on some fake shit”.\n\nFast forward to January 2019 when he would take to Instagram stating that he had deleted “everything” and wants to be “normal” again, essentially announcing his retirement.\n\nUzi has also mentioned his unfortunate deal in other songs:\n“Run It Up”\n\nMet the real Drama, a letdown\nThey look at me like a check now\n\n“Shoot (Noose)”\n\nI cannot wait ‘til I’m out of my deal, I need just all my residuals", "annotation_id": "37348134", "url": "https://genius.com/37348134", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "song", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "You Don’t Even Know", "status": "done", "targets": 2, "clicked": 0, "genius_url": "https://genius.com/Lil-uzi-vert-and-metro-boomin-you-dont-even-know-lyrics", "genius_title": "You Don’t Even Know", "genius_id": 11352331, "source": "api"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "You Better Move", "line": "When I hit my dance, got unlimited moves", "vault_lines": ["When I hit my dance, got unlimited moves"], "meaning": "Stating that Lil Uzi Vert is a good dancer and that when he dances he has too many moves to count. Most notably his dance moves to the song Just Wanna Rock.", "annotation_id": "33972843", "url": "https://genius.com/33972843", "state": "pending", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "You Better Move", "line": "Every chain on I pity a fool", "vault_lines": ["Every chain on I pity a fool"], "meaning": "This is a reference to Mr. T’s famous “I pity the fool” catchphrase, and his overabundance of neck chains.", "annotation_id": "30947018", "url": "https://genius.com/30947018", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "You Better Move", "line": "No, I’m not sweet, I just got flavor", "vault_lines": ["No, I'm not sweet, I just got flavor"], "meaning": "Uzi be dressin in some tight clothes and dying his hair, which are stereotypes for the gay community but he wants to make it clear that he’s just making himself stand-out so that he can later go fuck on yo bitch", "annotation_id": "21954618", "url": "https://genius.com/21954618", "state": "pending", "votes": 11, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "You Better Move", "line": "He want the smoke, but I don’t got a Juul", "vault_lines": ["He want the smoke, but I don't got a Juul"], "meaning": "“Juul” is a popular electronic cigarette. Rappers like Post Malone and Smokepurpp are known to smoke Juul’s.", "annotation_id": "21499106", "url": "https://genius.com/21499106", "state": "pending", "votes": 9, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "You Better Move", "line": "Neck is achoo, might catch the flu", "vault_lines": ["Neck is achoo, might catch the flu"], "meaning": "Lil Uzi Vert is sneezing ‘cause he’s neck is full of chains with incrusted diamonds, usually known as ice. The ice is cold, so he may have caught the flu.\n\nLil Uzi’s ice:", "annotation_id": "19606678", "url": "https://genius.com/19606678", "state": "pending", "votes": 6, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
