{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "You Better Move", "line": "Neck is achoo, might catch the flu", "vault_lines": ["Neck is achoo, might catch the flu"], "meaning": "Lil Uzi Vert is sneezing ‘cause he’s neck is full of chains with incrusted diamonds, usually known as ice. The ice is cold, so he may have caught the flu.\n\nLil Uzi’s ice:", "annotation_id": "19606659", "url": "https://genius.com/19606659", "state": "pending", "votes": 15, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "You Better Move", "line": "I don’t know why that girl so rude Oh, that’s ’cause her jeans, they from Rhude", "vault_lines": ["I don't know why that girl so rude"], "meaning": "Rhude is a luxury streetwear brand founded in 2015 by Rhuigi Villaseñor.\n\nUzi has been seen in the brand many times.\nhttps://www.instagram.com/rhuigi/p/Ba7nlXMlG6W/?hl=en\n\nVillaseñor has also acknowledged the shout out on twitter\n\nhttps://twitter.com/rhuigi/status/1235958064697815040", "annotation_id": "19325565", "url": "https://genius.com/19325565", "state": "pending", "votes": 19, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "You Better Move", "line": "Make ’em hit the folks every time that I shoot", "vault_lines": ["Make 'em hit the folks every time that I shoot"], "meaning": "This line interpolates Uzi’s unreleased song “Cutting My Wrists”, where he said a similar line.\n\nYeah, if you gon' shoot (Shoot)\nUh, fucknigga, you better shoot (Bah)\n\nIn this line Uzi is stating that every time he shoots his enemies he has them dancing. The shoot is also a dance move so it is a play on words.", "annotation_id": "19225392", "url": "https://genius.com/19225392", "state": "pending", "votes": 15, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "You Better Move", "line": "I remember when I didn’t have cable That was back when I used to watch Zoom", "vault_lines": ["Remember I used to play that pinball game?"], "meaning": "Keeping with the nostalgic references, Lil Uzi mentions Zoom, a children’s TV show that aired in the early 2000s on PBS Kids, a programming block on the public television network PBS.\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jwmslRaINno\nUzi mentions this show because as a child growing up without access to cable networks such as Nickelodeon and Disney Channel, the alternative was watching shows like Zoom on PBS.", "annotation_id": "19219799", "url": "https://genius.com/19219799", "state": "accepted", "votes": 31, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "You Better Move", "line": "I’m an iPod, man, you more like a Zune", "vault_lines": ["I'm an iPod, man, you more like a Zune"], "meaning": "Uzi likens himself to the Apple iPod while comparing his competition to the Microsoft Zune. The first iPod released in 2001 while the first Zune released in 2006. The Zune was expected to compete with the iPod but was discontinued in 2012.\n\n\n\n iPod (left) compared to Zune (right).", "annotation_id": "19219003", "url": "https://genius.com/19219003", "state": "accepted", "votes": 29, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "You Better Move", "line": "Bro moving 8 balls, not no pool", "vault_lines": ["Bro moving 8 balls, not no pool"], "meaning": "The 8-ball is the last ball which is traditionally to be pocketed in a game of pool. An 8 ball is also slang for cocaine- specifically 3.5 grams worth. The 8 ball that Uzi is referring to is cocaine and not pool.", "annotation_id": "19218975", "url": "https://genius.com/19218975", "state": "accepted", "votes": 24, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "You Better Move", "line": "Versace drawers, bitch, you Fruit of the Loom Yeah, yeah, Fruit of the Loom", "vault_lines": ["Versace drawers, bitch, you Fruit of the Loom"], "meaning": "Versace is a luxury Italian designer brand, while Fruit of the Loom is a common American clothing brand, best known for their large variety of affordable underwears. Uzi is comparing himself to Versace, a more luxurious brand, and a competitor to Fruit of the Loom, a more common brand.", "annotation_id": "19217319", "url": "https://genius.com/19217319", "state": "accepted", "votes": 26, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "You Better Move", "line": "Remember I used to play that pinball game?", "vault_lines": ["Remember I used to play that pinball game?"], "meaning": "The beat of this track samples sounds from 3D Pinball for Windows – Space Cadet, a version of the Space Cadet table game bundled with Microsoft Windows.\n\nThe game was originally packaged with Microsoft Plus! 95 and later included in Windows NT 4.0, Windows 2000, Windows ME, and Windows XP. At this time internet was only available via AOL.\n\nhttps://youtu.be/Zjahf8b1Itc?t=38", "annotation_id": "19217290", "url": "https://genius.com/19217290", "state": "accepted", "votes": 98, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "You Better Move", "line": "Green shirt, bitch, I’m Steve, where is Blue?", "vault_lines": ["Green shirt, bitch, I'm Steve, where is Blue?"], "meaning": "Blue’s Clues is a children’s cartoon program which follows the life of single homeowner Steve (Steve Burns) in search of clues to his dog, Blue’s daily whereabouts and plans. While the show’s immediate hosting successor, Joe (Donovan Patton), also wore green on occasion, Steve has never had a costume change.", "annotation_id": "19217283", "url": "https://genius.com/19217283", "state": "accepted", "votes": 46, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "You Better Move", "line": "Yu-Gi-Oh, Yu-Gi-Oh, you wanna duel? Blue-Eyes White Dragon, no, I will not lose", "vault_lines": ["Yu-Gi-Oh, Yu-Gi-Oh, you wanna duel?"], "meaning": "Yu-Gi-Oh is a trading card game that gained popularity in the US during the early 2000’s. The game consists of typically two players with their respective decks that “duel” to try and defeat their opponent.\n\nBlue-Eyes White Dragon is a popular card due to its prominence in the anime, and it’s relatively easy to “summon” for a card of its ATK power.", "annotation_id": "19217226", "url": "https://genius.com/19217226", "state": "accepted", "votes": 95, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
