{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Yessir", "line": "CDL on front eighteen-wheeler, bring in my dough", "vault_lines": ["CDL on front eighteen-wheeler, bring in my dough"], "meaning": "A CDL is a Commercial Driver’s License, which is required to drive large commercial vehicles like an 18-wheeler. Uzi is using this as a metaphor for his money coming in, saying that it’s coming in so fast and in such large quantities that it’s like a fleet of 18-wheelers delivering cash.", "annotation_id": "36605249", "url": "https://genius.com/36605249", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Yessir", "line": "BBL on them, I got extra tens, I got side hoes", "vault_lines": ["BBL on them, I got extra tens, I got side hoes"], "meaning": "BBL stands for Brazilian Butt Lift. He’s referring to women who have had this surgery. “Extra tens” refers to a rating Uzi is giving these women, commonly associated with being “perfect” or “flawless”. He’s flexing that he has multiple side women that most would yearn for in his life.", "annotation_id": "36605246", "url": "https://genius.com/36605246", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
