{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Yessir", "line": "”Yes, sir”, that’s what she say when she want somethin’ (Huh?)", "vault_lines": ["\"Yes, sir\", that's what she say when she want somethin' (Huh?)"], "meaning": "He’s noting that her respectful “yes, sir” only comes out when she’s asking for a favor or money.", "annotation_id": "36605229", "url": "https://genius.com/36605229", "state": "pending", "votes": -1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
