{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Yea Hoe", "line": "Fuck with some C’s, fuck with big B’s, driving around in a Bentley", "vault_lines": ["Fuck with some C's, fuck with big B's, driving around in a Bentley"], "meaning": "Uh, yeah, fuck with them Bloods, uh, yeah, fuck with them Crips\n\nUzi has connections to a lot of gangs, such as the Crips and Bloods.\n\n\n\nWhile Thugger is riding around in his Ferarri, Lil Uzi is cruising in his Bentley.", "annotation_id": "8637864", "url": "https://genius.com/8637864", "state": "accepted", "votes": 9, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Yea Hoe", "line": "Diamonds on my wrist clearer than Blu-Ray", "vault_lines": ["Diamonds on my wrist clearer than Blu-Ray"], "meaning": "Uzi compares the clarity of his diamonds to the HD Blu-Ray dvd system with 3D picture quality.\n\nHis VVS diamonds look transparent like water, projecting and refracting colors in rays of light.\n\nChain on, sub zero\n\nhttps://www.instagram.com/p/BLHBNd4hbA9/?taken-by=benballer", "annotation_id": "8624001", "url": "https://genius.com/8624001", "state": "accepted", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Yea Hoe", "line": "Pull up in my Yeezy Boosts Ya I don’t follow no rules", "vault_lines": ["Pull up in my Yeezy Boosts"], "meaning": "Uzi’s no stranger to Kanye West’s Yeezy Boosts  as he’s rocking a pair of the Yeezy Boost 950 in the picture below. The 950’s are retailed at $585.", "annotation_id": "8598173", "url": "https://genius.com/8598173", "state": "accepted", "votes": 7, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Yea Hoe", "line": "Okay I might pull out in a ’Rarri yea (skrrrt) I got to get my dough, I stack my money yea", "vault_lines": ["Okay I might pull out in a 'Rarri yea (skrrrt)"], "meaning": "Since Uzi has money now, a few hundred thousand  splurged on luxury sports cars is nothing.\n\nThis isn’t the first time Uzi’s contemplated pulling up/out in a ‘Rarri.\n\nI Might Pull up in a Rari, I Swear that Shit is not Normal", "annotation_id": "8598089", "url": "https://genius.com/8598089", "state": "accepted", "votes": 7, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
