{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Yamborghini Dream", "line": "My gun can’t fit on my hip, ayy", "vault_lines": ["My gun can't fit on my hip, ayy"], "meaning": "Lil Uzi Vert is implying that he may carry the famous hand cannon known as the Desert Eagle Fifty which is known to be extremely powerful as it uses centrefire ammunation.\n\nMost rappers carry this god of a pistol as it is quite powerful and looks really intimidating.\n\nMy gun can’t fit on my hip, ay.\nThe reason why it doesn’t fit on his waist as it weighs 1998.6 grams 71.4 oz. and that is just the gun with the cartridge empty!", "annotation_id": "13689417", "url": "https://genius.com/13689417", "state": "accepted", "votes": 15, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Yamborghini Dream", "line": "I’m havin’ rings like a motherfuckin’ lord", "vault_lines": ["I'm havin' rings like a motherfuckin' lord"], "meaning": "Young Thug is referencing the famous fantasy series by author J.R.R Tolkein The Lord of the Rings.", "annotation_id": "11238227", "url": "https://genius.com/11238227", "state": "accepted", "votes": 5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Yamborghini Dream", "line": "I pour fours in a cream soda", "vault_lines": ["I pour fours in a cream soda"], "meaning": "Thug poured four ounces of Codeine into cream soda to make lean. He’s possibly drinking it in honor of A$AP Yams, who had Codeine in his system when he died.\n\nhttps://twitter.com/asapyams/status/556334494048067584", "annotation_id": "8852165", "url": "https://genius.com/8852165", "state": "pending", "votes": 17, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Yamborghini Dream", "line": "You know that movie Blow? Yeah, they based that right off me", "vault_lines": ["You know that movie Blow?"], "meaning": "The movie “Blow” is about selling cocaine. Uzi is saying that the whole plot is based on Uzi’s life because he also sells cocaine.", "annotation_id": "8626916", "url": "https://genius.com/8626916", "state": "accepted", "votes": 20, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Yamborghini Dream", "line": "Eenie miney meenie miney mo Eenie miney meenie miney mo Eenie miney meenie miney mo Eenie miney meenie miney mo Eenie miney meenie miney mo Eenie miney meenie miney mo Which one? Like, eenie miney meenie miney mo Which one? Like, eenie miney meenie miney mo", "vault_lines": ["Eenie miney meenie miney mo"], "meaning": "Young Thug is trying to choose which Lamborghini he wants to buy using the children’s counting rhyme eeny, meeny, miny, moe, and the last one his finger points to he’ll buy. And there’s so many options!", "annotation_id": "8315415", "url": "https://genius.com/8315415", "state": "accepted", "votes": 61, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Yamborghini Dream", "line": "I’m cookin’ the white girls for my boy", "vault_lines": ["I'm cookin' the white girls for my boy"], "meaning": "White Girls is slang for cocaine. Thugger is up in the kitchen cooking cocaine for his gang to sell because he’s the real MVP.", "annotation_id": "8315396", "url": "https://genius.com/8315396", "state": "accepted", "votes": 21, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Yamborghini Dream", "line": "My dope white like South Dakota", "vault_lines": ["My dope white like South Dakota"], "meaning": "Thug says here that the dope he possesses is top quality, and uses the demography of the mid-western state of South Dakota as a metaphor for just how white it is.\n\nThe state is, mind you, populated by 85% Caucasians, 9% Native Americans, 3% Latinos, and almost 2% Blacks.", "annotation_id": "8311670", "url": "https://genius.com/8311670", "state": "accepted", "votes": 10, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Yamborghini Dream", "line": "My ice wet just like Daytona", "vault_lines": ["My ice wet just like Daytona"], "meaning": "Thug compares his ice (diamonds) to the climate in Daytona Beach, Florida. The Bermuda High pumps in hot and unstable tropical air from the Gulf of Mexico into Daytona, resulting in a lot of thundershowers.", "annotation_id": "8093289", "url": "https://genius.com/8093289", "state": "accepted", "votes": 11, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Yamborghini Dream", "line": "I mix the lean with the Xan Rest in peace to A$AP Yams", "vault_lines": ["I fuck with the Bentley"], "meaning": "Just like Soulja Boy, Lil Uzi likes mixing Xanax with his lean to make the concoction even more powerful.\n\nVert then shouts out A$AP Yams who tragically died earlier in the year from a lean and xanax overdose.", "annotation_id": "8088542", "url": "https://genius.com/8088542", "state": "accepted", "votes": 47, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Yamborghini Dream", "line": "And my diamonds are black like Folger’s", "vault_lines": ["And my diamonds are black like Folger's"], "meaning": "Thugger uses yet another in a long line of literary devices to brag about the purity of his diamonds. In this case he compares his diamond’s blackness to Folger’s dark coffee.", "annotation_id": "8088527", "url": "https://genius.com/8088527", "state": "accepted", "votes": 9, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Yamborghini Dream", "line": "I’m the boss, I’m that boy I want millions with Floyd", "vault_lines": ["I'm the boss, I'm that boy"], "meaning": "As a boss, Thugger one day aspires to become as rich as boxer Floyd Mayweather, who is worth over 500 million dollars and is the poster boy for flexing.", "annotation_id": "8088518", "url": "https://genius.com/8088518", "state": "accepted", "votes": 28, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Yamborghini Dream", "line": "I’m with the 808 Mafia You want war, then I ain’t stoppin’ ya", "vault_lines": ["I want millions with Floyd"], "meaning": "I want war nigga\nPull up, pull up, pull up, I need war nigga\n\nYoung Thug frequently collaborates with the producer group 808 Mafia, most notably with Southside and the producer of this song, TM88.\n\nAlso Thug is always ready for war, as he articulated on “I Need War”.", "annotation_id": "8088507", "url": "https://genius.com/8088507", "state": "accepted", "votes": 32, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
