{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Yah Yah Yah", "line": "One-piece, Raf Simons, Michael Myers", "vault_lines": ["...One-piece, Raf Simons, Michael Myers"], "meaning": "Michael Myers is a horror movie icon, who originates from the 1978 film Halloween.\n\nThe films popularity makes his signature outift consisting of a white mask, blue jumpsuit, and large kitchen knife easily recognizable.\n\n[Raf Simons made a jumpsuit, featured in their Spring-Summer 2002 “Fear Generation” collection, that drew inspiration from the jumpsuit Michael Myres wore in the films.]  (https://www.grailed.com/listings/47128939-raf-simons-ss-02-raf-simons-feargeneration-collection-boiler-jumper)", "annotation_id": "17428725", "url": "https://genius.com/17428725", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
