{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "YSL", "line": "I don’t go nowhere without my ruler", "vault_lines": ["I don't go nowhere without my ruler"], "meaning": "Slang for a long gun. In this line, Uzi claims that he’s always ready for anyone to pull up on him, saying he brings his gun everywhere.", "annotation_id": "22766703", "url": "https://genius.com/22766703", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "YSL", "line": "5600, nigga, Lansdowne, nigga, how I be rockin’ and how I be layin’, nigga", "vault_lines": ["5600, nigga, Lansdowne, nigga, how I be rockin' and how I be layin', nigga"], "meaning": "Lansdowne is a city located about 6 miles southwest of Philadelphia, PA, which is where Uzi is from. However, Uzi is not saying this, as Uzi is from the 1600 block in Francisville, the person saying this is presumed to be a friend of Uzi’s who is from the 5600 block in Lansdowne.", "annotation_id": "20402896", "url": "https://genius.com/20402896", "state": "pending", "votes": 7, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "YSL", "line": "Ruler (Bah, bah) Ruler (Bah) Ruler (Yeah) Ruler (What?) Ruler (Hey, hey) Ruler (Hey) That’s why I don’t go nowhere without my ruler", "vault_lines": ["I don't go nowhere without my ruler"], "meaning": "Ruler is a gun which Uzi takes with him everywhere he goes. The term “ruler” likely refers to the extended clip in the gun which is about a foot long.", "annotation_id": "19778172", "url": "https://genius.com/19778172", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
