{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Woke Up Rich", "line": "No, I’m not talking Minnesota, boy, I’m talking polar", "vault_lines": ["No, I'm not talking Minnesota, boy, I'm talking polar"], "meaning": "While talking about how cold his ice is, Uzi refers to his ice as “polar”, referencing the Massachusetts based beverage brand that produces seltzer and sodas.", "annotation_id": "30675561", "url": "https://genius.com/30675561", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
