{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "With Your Girl", "line": "I just bought her one Birkin, that shit cost like three bags", "vault_lines": ["I just bought her one Birkin, that shit cost like three bags"], "meaning": "A Birkin is a luxury handbag made by the French fashion brand Hermès. It’s famous for being very expensive, exclusive, and difficult to get.\n\nLil Uzi Vert is saying that he bought a woman a Birkin bag, which is a very expensive luxury handbag made by Hermès. When he says it “cost like three bags,” he’s emphasizing how expensive the Birkin was—he’s comparing the price of that one bag to the combined cost of about three other expensive designer bags.", "annotation_id": "41066180", "url": "https://genius.com/41066180", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "With Your Girl", "line": "One Louis, one Goyard and double C bag Buffy, Buffy, Buffy, Cartier", "vault_lines": ["Too much, one Louis, one Goyard and double C bag"], "meaning": "Lil Uzi Vert is bragging about having a lot of expensive designer items. “Louis” refers to Louis Vuitton, “Goyard” is another high-end fashion brand, and “double C” refers to Chanel’s interlocking C logo. When Lil Uzi Vert says “one Louis, one Goyard and double C bag,” he’s listing multiple luxury bags from different brands. He then mentions Cartier, another expensive luxury brand, to highlight his jewelry and wealth. Overall, Lil Uzi Vert is painting a picture of himself surrounded by expensive designer bags and jewelry, showing off his wealth, fashion, and lavish lifestyle.", "annotation_id": "41066162", "url": "https://genius.com/41066162", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "With Your Girl", "line": "Pull up in my brand new Bentley, this shit cost like three Jags", "vault_lines": ["Pull up in my brand new Bentley, this shit cost like three Jags"], "meaning": "Bentley and Jaguar are both luxury car companies known for producing expensive, high-end vehicles. Lil Uzi is trying to emphasize how expensive his new Bentley is by comparing its price to three Jaguar cars.", "annotation_id": "41066111", "url": "https://genius.com/41066111", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "With Your Girl", "line": "Oogie Mane, he killed it", "vault_lines": ["Hello? Who the fuck is this? The fuck"], "meaning": "Producer tag for the producer “Oogie Mane”\n\nOriginally taken from the song, “Overwhelming” by Matt OX.", "annotation_id": "40640772", "url": "https://genius.com/40640772", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
