{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "With My Slime", "line": "I count the blue just like Corbin", "vault_lines": ["I count the blue just like Corbin"], "meaning": "Lil Uzi Vert cleverly boasts about the new blue tint of the hundred dollar bills by referencing High School Musical actor Corbin Bleu.\n\n\n\nUzi later references Corbin Bleu multiple times throughout his discography on tracks like April 2018’s Rich Forever Leaked.\n\nCatch a carbon, that’s a Corbin\nBlue tips in the FN", "annotation_id": "14999165", "url": "https://genius.com/14999165", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
