{"type": "song", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Win a Lot", "status": "done", "targets": 0, "clicked": 0, "genius_url": "https://genius.com/Bouba-savage-win-a-lot-lyrics", "genius_title": "Win a Lot", "genius_id": 8764104, "source": "api"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Why You Starin", "line": "You cannot see me, yeah, cameras flash at me, yeah Talkin’ TMZ, yeah, now she wanna stay, no, but she wanna leave, yeah But she cannot go ’cause the money comin’, ayy Money comin’, ayy, all she want is dough That’s how I know, that lil’ bitch ain’t nothin’ That lil’ bitch ain’t nothin’, she ain’t nothin’ but a ho, woah", "vault_lines": ["You cannot see me, yeah, camo' all on me, yeah"], "meaning": "Uzi talks about his exorbitant wealth & fame as well as the women who are only with him to get a piece of it.\n\nTMZ is a celebrity gossip website that provides insider information on celebrities. They usually swarm celebrities with multiple personnel & cameras, and when said cameras flash it is hard to see the celebrities under the bright flashing lights; Uzi refers to this in these lyrics.\n\nAdditionally, Uzi laments about the women who only date him to be on TMZ & to get a piece of his wealth. they add to this by stating that they don’t want to be with him when it doesn’t involve those, & they call them all hoes.", "annotation_id": "28007071", "url": "https://genius.com/28007071", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Why You Starin", "line": "Diamonds on my feet, ayy, Christian Louboutin’s, ayy", "vault_lines": ["Diamonds on my feet, ayy, Christian Louboutin's, ayy"], "meaning": "Christian Louboutin Ltd. is a French luxury company mostly known for high-end shiny, red-lacquered sole footwear. Uzi has mentioned these in songs prior, such as “The Way Life Goes”, where they sing the lyrics:\n\nMy Louboutins new, so my bottoms, they is redder", "annotation_id": "27992040", "url": "https://genius.com/27992040", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Why You Starin", "line": "Diamonds water, yeah, diamonds water, yeah Diamonds water, like I’m King Neptune", "vault_lines": ["Diamonds water, yeah, diamonds water, yeah"], "meaning": "Uzi makes a nod to the cartoon character King Neptune from Spongebob Squarepants, who is a powerful, trident-wielding merman god who rules the sea. Uzi refers to him by calling their diamonds water, which is slang for VVS. VVS is the clearest of all diamonds, which is where it gets the nickname. King Neptune also wears gold wristbands and a matching crown decorated with a scallop ornament, plus a gold belt bearing a seahorse emblem; this could be a nod to Uzi’s exorbitant jewelry and wealth, which is comparable to royalty.", "annotation_id": "27944942", "url": "https://genius.com/27944942", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Why You Starin", "line": "Slidin’ in that Lamb’, this is not a rental (Slidin’ in that Lamby)", "vault_lines": ["Slidin' in that Lamb', this is not a rental (Slidin' in that Lamby)"], "meaning": "Referring to that he is driving his Lamborghini that he owns and it’s not a rental car.", "annotation_id": "27828845", "url": "https://genius.com/27828845", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
