{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "White Water LUV", "line": "I’m the captain on this ship, Johnny Depp", "vault_lines": ["I'm the captain on this ship, Johnny Depp"], "meaning": "Uzi has the leadership within his gang, like how Johnny Depp’s character leads with authority in the “Pirates of the Caribbean” movies. It shows Uzi’s confidence and dominance in his social circle, like the way Captain Jack Sparrow commands attention and respect in his crew.", "annotation_id": "31683233", "url": "https://genius.com/31683233", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "White Water LUV", "line": "I feel like Stella Got my groove back, I’m feelin’ better (Feelin’ better)", "vault_lines": ["Got my groove back, I'm feelin' better (Feelin' better)"], "meaning": "Uzi references Stella who is the main character in the movie “How Stella Got Her Groove Back.” The film follows Stella, a successful career woman who finds love and rejuvenation while on vacation in Jamaica. He adds that he regained his confidence and energy just like the character in the movie who rediscovers her vitality and happiness.", "annotation_id": "31683110", "url": "https://genius.com/31683110", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
