{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "What’s the Move", "line": "Flexin’ on these haters who sent me ‘my bad’", "vault_lines": ["Flexin' on these haters who sent me 'my bad'"], "meaning": "Uzi says “Flexin' on these haters, oops, I mean, my bad”\n\nThey use “my bad” sarcastically to convey their apathy towards those who dismiss their accomplishments—the haters.\n\nIn addition, their sarcastic tone reveals the intent to continue to “flex on these haters” as Uzi does not owe an apology to anyone for living their life the way they intend.", "annotation_id": "31515503", "url": "https://genius.com/31515503", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
