{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "What’s Up (Guap)", "line": "Pop that boy like a Xan’", "vault_lines": ["Pop that boy like a Xan'"], "meaning": "Popping is another way of saying shooting. Uzi finna shoot or pop, in this case, pop a boy like Xanax. Popping Xanax means he’s gonna snort Xanax.", "annotation_id": "22019741", "url": "https://genius.com/22019741", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
