{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "What You Saying", "line": "I don’t even know what she said ’cause she foreign (Let’s go) Yeah, she foreign", "vault_lines": ["I don't even know what she said 'cause she foreign (Let's go)"], "meaning": "PROPOSED SUGGESTION:\n\nThis part refers to the sample used when producing the beat, it comes from the french song “Love Story” by Indila. This verse suggest that Lil Uzi Vert just probably doesn’t understand the foreign language from the sample.", "annotation_id": "39450789", "url": "https://genius.com/39450789", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
