{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "What You Saying", "line": "Look the same in morning (Woah)", "vault_lines": ["Look the same in morning (Woah)"], "meaning": "She looks good in the morning without makeup. She’s got natural beauty", "annotation_id": "38718620", "url": "https://genius.com/38718620", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "What You Saying", "line": "I guess that we on the same page ’cause I’m just tryna strike (Okay, I really do get you, woah)", "vault_lines": ["I guess that we on the same page 'cause I'm just tryna strike (Okay, I really do get you, woah)"], "meaning": "A nod to the previous line, Uzi clarifies that his intentions with this woman are purely sexual (“I’m just tryna strike”), and he wants nothing further.\n\nUzi assumes that she shares this sentiment, and thus the two are “on the same page”.", "annotation_id": "38103346", "url": "https://genius.com/38103346", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "What You Saying", "line": "Is it ’cause that I’m paid, you tryna stay the night?", "vault_lines": ["Is it 'cause that I'm paid, you tryna stay the night?"], "meaning": "Uzi overtly questions the motivations of his love interest, wondering whether she’s only getting with him because of his money and status.", "annotation_id": "38103338", "url": "https://genius.com/38103338", "state": "pending", "votes": 5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "What You Saying", "line": "Like the way she ’forms", "vault_lines": ["Like the way she 'forms"], "meaning": "Unabbreviated, Uzi “likes the way she performs it”, meaning he is pleased with the manner in which his sexual partner is performing sexual acts upon him.", "annotation_id": "38103288", "url": "https://genius.com/38103288", "state": "pending", "votes": 8, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "What You Saying", "line": "I don’t even know what she said ’cause she foreign (Let’s go) Yeah, she foreign", "vault_lines": ["I don't even know what she said 'cause she foreign (Let's go)"], "meaning": "A nod to the French musical sample which underpins the track, Uzi boast that the woman he’s engaging in sexual intercourse with is foreign (likely French), to such an extent that he can’t even understand what she’s saying when she speaks.\n\nUzi is flexing the fact that his status enables him to get with women who cannot even speak english or communicate with him.", "annotation_id": "38103218", "url": "https://genius.com/38103218", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "What You Saying", "line": "She don’t stop, keep going", "vault_lines": ["She don't stop, keep going"], "meaning": "Much like the previous, “And she got endurance” line ‘Lil Uzi is acknowledging how his female parter has lots of stamina for sexual intercourse.", "annotation_id": "38082644", "url": "https://genius.com/38082644", "state": "pending", "votes": 9, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "What You Saying", "line": "What I make in a day, what they make in a life", "vault_lines": ["What I make in a day, what they make in a life"], "meaning": "The line “What I make in a day, what they make in a life” is a classic hip-hop exaggeration used to emphasize extreme financial success. Lil Uzi Vert contrasts his daily earnings with what others earn over an entire lifetime, reinforcing themes of wealth, status, and superiority that are common in rap lyrics.", "annotation_id": "38080188", "url": "https://genius.com/38080188", "state": "pending", "votes": 5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "What You Saying", "line": "(MC, make another hit)", "vault_lines": ["I don't even know what she said 'cause she foreign (Let's go)"], "meaning": "“MC, make another hit!” is a producer tag used by MCVertt, a Jersey club producer. MCVertt is known for working closely with New Jersey rapper Bandmanrill and for co-producing Lil Uzi Vert’s 2022 hit Just Wanna Rock, which played a key role in popularizing Jersey club in mainstream hip-hop.", "annotation_id": "38080156", "url": "https://genius.com/38080156", "state": "pending", "votes": 9, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "What You Saying", "line": "[Chorus: Lil Uzi Vert]", "vault_lines": ["I don't even know what she said 'cause she foreign (Let's go)"], "meaning": "The sampled song, “Love Story” by Indila, is in the French language. Lil Uzi Vert is saying he doesn’t understand French (“she’s foreign”) but hears the song “Love Story” in his head.", "annotation_id": "38076671", "url": "https://genius.com/38076671", "state": "pending", "votes": 7, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "What You Saying", "line": "[Refrain: Lil Uzi Vert & Indila]", "vault_lines": ["I don't even know what she said 'cause she foreign (Let's go)"], "meaning": "The vocals heard in the refrain and throughout the track comes from the French singer Indila’s 2014 track, “Love Story”.\n\nThe English translation of the refrain is as follows:\n\nHe, he’s not a fool, he loves her, that’s all\nHe sees her everywhere waits for her, upright\nUpright, a rose in the hand, no, nothing holds him back, no more\nIn his love story\nIn his love story\nIn his love story\nHis love story", "annotation_id": "38030373", "url": "https://genius.com/38030373", "state": "accepted", "votes": 31, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
