{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "What Did I Say", "line": "Text me, ”Outer space”, yeah, like Invader Zim, yeah (Huh?)", "vault_lines": ["Text me, \"Outer space\", yeah, like Invader Zim, yeah (Huh?)"], "meaning": "Small lil wordplay for poeple who may not know.\n\nInvader Zim is a cartoon about an alien from outer space who comes to Earth pretending to be human.", "annotation_id": "40440841", "url": "https://genius.com/40440841", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
