{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Werewolf", "line": "Witness me (Witness me)", "vault_lines": ["Deep down, I'm jealous of the daywalkers"], "meaning": "Possible reference to the Mad Max franchise as this is the battle cry of the War Boys before they sacrifice themselves", "annotation_id": "31952845", "url": "https://genius.com/31952845", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Werewolf", "line": "Ah-ah, ah, ah, ah, ah", "vault_lines": ["Deep down, I'm jealous of the daywalkers"], "meaning": "Interestingly, this is one of Deftones vocalist Chino Moreno’s signature ad libs, which pairs perfectly with this nu metal instrumental from BMTH.", "annotation_id": "31324039", "url": "https://genius.com/31324039", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Werewolf", "line": "Deep down, I’m jealous of the daywalkers", "vault_lines": ["Deep down, I'm jealous of the daywalkers"], "meaning": "a “daywalker” refers to a type of vampire or half-vampire who can walk in the daylight without harm. In this sense, Uzi is jealous of those who can live life without the influence of the dark things ( dark=night, i.e. a nightwalker). They could be referring to their heavy drug use causing them to miss out on brighter things in life.", "annotation_id": "29033766", "url": "https://genius.com/29033766", "state": "pending", "votes": 12, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Werewolf", "line": "Underground", "vault_lines": ["Nowhere left to go now but underground"], "meaning": "underground could refer to multiple things. I think in this context it is referring to hell, or death. saying they didn’t make it into heaven and they burned out their nine lives so now they have to make their final decent into the depths which is all that is left for them.", "annotation_id": "28947799", "url": "https://genius.com/28947799", "state": "pending", "votes": 8, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Werewolf", "line": "And I’ll never get past the borderline", "vault_lines": ["And I'll never get past the borderline"], "meaning": "I think the borderline is a reference to the line between heaven and hell or good and evil. They are saying they can’t make it past no matter how hard they try to be on the good side, based on their past and their actions.", "annotation_id": "28947796", "url": "https://genius.com/28947796", "state": "pending", "votes": 10, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Werewolf", "line": "Deep down, I’m jealous of the daywalkers When nighttime comes I stare at the moon And I turn into a stalker Witness me", "vault_lines": ["Deep down, I'm jealous of the daywalkers"], "meaning": "Uzi is, as the title suggests, a Werewolf, at least metaphorically. The Werewolf Uzi has turned into may be the new kind of artist they have turned into or the sound they have experimented with on this project.\n\nUzi feels like they are different from others. They think differently. They are, by proxy, the Werewolf.\n\nPROPOSED SUGGESTION: “witness me” is likely a reference to Fury Road\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=x2CeDY9Ywhs", "annotation_id": "28944882", "url": "https://genius.com/28944882", "state": "pending", "votes": 28, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Werewolf", "line": "And this darkness has become a haven I’m going deeper underground, can’t face it", "vault_lines": ["And this darkness has become a haven"], "meaning": "It might be about transformation of somebody, which, according to Oli, will be hated by others, but simultaneously is the only right and aware option.", "annotation_id": "28943534", "url": "https://genius.com/28943534", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
