{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Wed and Thurs", "line": "She know my money is long, yeah, my shit colossal", "vault_lines": ["She know my money is long, yeah, my shit colossal"], "meaning": "“Money Longer” is one of Lil Uzi Vert’s older songs, as well as a term he often uses to say he has a lot of money, and Colossal is another way of saying very huge (as in his money is colossal or massive)", "annotation_id": "40055799", "url": "https://genius.com/40055799", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
