{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "We Good", "line": "Mama text my phone, ask me, “You okay?” (I’m good, ma) Mama, swear we good, hundred on the way (We good, ma)", "vault_lines": ["Mama text my phone, ask me, \"You okay?\" (I'm good, ma)"], "meaning": "Uzi is showing care and communication with his mother. Even while busy or dealing with life, he reassures her both emotionally (“we good”) and materially (“hundred on the way”). It blends personal relationships with flexing responsibility.", "annotation_id": "36872119", "url": "https://genius.com/36872119", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "We Good", "line": "I don’t share my drop, but she still got my lo’", "vault_lines": ["I don't share my drop, but she still got my lo'"], "meaning": "He keeps his whereabouts secret, but she still knows where he is.", "annotation_id": "36872074", "url": "https://genius.com/36872074", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "We Good", "line": "Yeah, new contract, I read mines (Huh?) They said I was lost (Huh?)", "vault_lines": ["Yeah, new contract, I read mines (Huh?)"], "meaning": "Lil Uzi Vert uses these lines to address recent rumors and challenges head-on. The “new contract” represents a renewed sense of confidence and a commitment to pushing forward. When Uzi raps, “They thought I was a dead guy,” he’s calling out critics who had written him off or considered him past his prime. He also alludes to personal struggles and controversies, including a nod to his use of nitrous oxide, which he openly acknowledges in this track.", "annotation_id": "35981663", "url": "https://genius.com/35981663", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "We Good", "line": "Mama text my phone, ask me, “You okay?” (I’m good, ma) Mama, swear we good, hundred on the way (We good, ma, woah)", "vault_lines": ["Mama text my phone, ask me, \"You okay?\" (I'm good, ma)"], "meaning": "Lil Uzi Vert refers to the idea that his family, more particularly his mother– are worried about them due to their drug addiction previously mentioned within the song.\n\nIn these lines, Lil Uzi Vert reassures his mother that he is alright now, and that money is coming their way.", "annotation_id": "35748220", "url": "https://genius.com/35748220", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "We Good", "line": "Bitch, I’m here to stay, that’s the way it’s gonna go", "vault_lines": ["Bitch, I'm here to stay, that's the way it's gonna go"], "meaning": "Many people, as of recent, have been calling Uzi “washed” and saying that he “needs to retire.” Uzi reassures everybody that he isnt going anyone and is “here to stay.”", "annotation_id": "35702422", "url": "https://genius.com/35702422", "state": "pending", "votes": -1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "We Good", "line": "Takin’ all these drugs, I got funny face (I got funny face)", "vault_lines": ["Takin' all these drugs, I got funny face (I got funny face)"], "meaning": "The drugs Uzi mentions leave them with exaggerated facial expressions, potentially referencing their use of substances like Percocet or MDMA.", "annotation_id": "33686084", "url": "https://genius.com/33686084", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "We Good", "line": "Told ’em I’ma eat out just like ándale (Just like ándale)", "vault_lines": ["Told 'em I'ma eat out just like ándale (Just like ándale)"], "meaning": "“Andale,” is Spanish for “hurry up,”", "annotation_id": "33686076", "url": "https://genius.com/33686076", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "We Good", "line": "She tryna show off for Uzi, that’s for sure", "vault_lines": ["She tryna show off for Uzi, that's for sure"], "meaning": "This is a classic flex about women seeking their attention due to their fame and “swag.” Uzi’s status makes them a magnet for clout chasers, a theme they frequently explores in their music.", "annotation_id": "33686061", "url": "https://genius.com/33686061", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "We Good", "line": "Smokin’ gas, don’t cough But it gave me the red eyes", "vault_lines": ["Smokin' gas, don't cough"], "meaning": "Weed gives you red strained eyes", "annotation_id": "33601150", "url": "https://genius.com/33601150", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "We Good", "line": "Smokin’ gas, don’t cough But it gave me the red eyes", "vault_lines": ["Smokin' gas, don't cough"], "meaning": "Weed gives you red strained eyes", "annotation_id": "33601145", "url": "https://genius.com/33601145", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "We Good", "line": "Everybody thought I was leanin’, I was really triple beanin", "vault_lines": ["Everybody thought I was leanin', I was really triple beanin"], "meaning": "Lean, a concoction of candy, soda, and cough syrup, is a popular recreational beverage that rappers reference quite often. Pop a bean is slang for taking the street drug, MDMA (commonly known as Molly) since Uzi said triple beanin that means he’s taking three pills at a time which could cause an overdose.", "annotation_id": "33508374", "url": "https://genius.com/33508374", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "We Good", "line": "But it gave me the red eyes (Woah)", "vault_lines": ["But it gave me the red eyes (Woah)"], "meaning": "Some smokers notice their eyes can become red when they smoke. Uzi here says that he doesn’t cough when he smokes weed, but his eyes do turn red.", "annotation_id": "33505403", "url": "https://genius.com/33505403", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "We Good", "line": "But it gave me the red eyes (Woah)", "vault_lines": ["But it gave me the red eyes (Woah)"], "meaning": "Red eyes – in this context– means uzi is high.\n\nThis is the reason Goddard, his robot dog, mistranslated the song title to “Im cooked” which in this context means uzi is high", "annotation_id": "33487699", "url": "https://genius.com/33487699", "state": "pending", "votes": -1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "We Good", "line": "Yeah, new contract, I read mines (Huh?) They said I was lost (Huh?) They thought I was a dead guy (Yes)", "vault_lines": ["Yeah, new contract, I read mines (Huh?)"], "meaning": "Lil Uzi Vert uses these lines to address recent rumors and challenges head-on. The “new contract” represents a renewed sense of confidence and a commitment to pushing forward. When Uzi raps, “They thought I was a dead guy,” he’s calling out critics who had written him off or considered him past his prime. He also alludes to personal struggles and controversies, including a nod to his use of nitrous oxide, which he openly acknowledges in this track.", "annotation_id": "33477484", "url": "https://genius.com/33477484", "state": "accepted", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "We Good", "line": "They thought I was a dead guy", "vault_lines": ["They thought I was a dead guy (Yes)"], "meaning": "People haven’t heard from Uzi in so long they\n may have believed he was dead. (if you are dead it is really difficult to drop music)", "annotation_id": "33475419", "url": "https://genius.com/33475419", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "We Good", "line": "Smallest car was a Redeye (Skrrt)", "vault_lines": ["Smallest car was a Redeye (Skrrt)"], "meaning": "He it talking about a Dodge Challenger SRT Hellcat Redeye, this car is extremely loud and he is saying it is his “smallest one”", "annotation_id": "33474617", "url": "https://genius.com/33474617", "state": "pending", "votes": 5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "We Good", "line": "Alright, alright, alright, I swear everything’s alright", "vault_lines": ["Alright, alright, alright, I swear everything's alright"], "meaning": "In August of 2024, multiple videos circulated showing Uzi inhaling from a balloon while recording in the studio. These videos have gotten many fans concerned for their health and safety, because of the many dangerous side effects that nitrous oxide, otherwise known as laughing gas has if used recreationally.\n\nHere, Uzi follows up on the chorus where they admit to being on nitrous oxide by swearing that everything’s alright, and that their fans shouldn’t worry about them.", "annotation_id": "33473043", "url": "https://genius.com/33473043", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "We Good", "line": "EA 2 EA 2", "vault_lines": ["Yeah, new contract, I read mines (Huh?)"], "meaning": "The intro features a sample from the 2022 released song “Very Online Guy” by the Canadian pop band Alvvays.", "annotation_id": "33472814", "url": "https://genius.com/33472814", "state": "accepted", "votes": 13, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "We Good", "line": "Smokin’ gas, don’t cough", "vault_lines": ["Smokin' gas, don't cough"], "meaning": "‘Gas’ here is being referred to  NOS (Nitrous Oxide) aka Galaxy gas . There was a video circulating on internet which showed Uzi working on studio inhaling NOS from a balloon.", "annotation_id": "33471887", "url": "https://genius.com/33471887", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "We Good", "line": "All white, all white, all white, but I’m really still the demon", "vault_lines": ["All white, all white, all white, but I'm really still the demon"], "meaning": "On Lil Uzi Vert’s instagram bio he says “ALL WHITE ALL WHITE ALL WHITE !!!!”, this most likely refers to the cover art of the teaser “Uzi The Earthling! (TV Show Theme)”\n\n\n\nThis ‘keyhole’ art was inspired by the original cover art for Eternal Atake, inspired by the Heaven’s Gate Cult.\n\n\n\n\n\nThe original cover art for Eternal Atake however wasn’t used due to copyright issues.\n\nThe rollout of Eternal Atake 2 included Uzi changing all of his previous albums cover art by adding the image of the white cover on top of them.\n\n\n\nLil Uzi Vert also used this same keyhole outline in the cover of New Patek", "annotation_id": "33467283", "url": "https://genius.com/33467283", "state": "pending", "votes": 13, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "We Good", "line": "I was on that NOS (Lil Uzi)", "vault_lines": ["I was on that NOS (Lil Uzi)"], "meaning": "NOS, also known as “laughing gas” or nitrous oxide, is a gas that produces short-term euphoria and a sense of relaxation, though it carries potential health risks when used recreationally. Recently, both Kanye West and Uzi have faced criticism from fans disappointed with their apparent reliance on NOS.", "annotation_id": "33466870", "url": "https://genius.com/33466870", "state": "accepted", "votes": 98, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
