{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Wasted", "line": "Damn, why is she so demonic? She Medusa with a little Pocahontas", "vault_lines": ["Damn, why is she so demonic?"], "meaning": "Kind of trying just draw the element of, “Devil in a red dress”-type vibe. Seductive. Medusa used to just seduct people and turn them into stone, so that seductive element in the song. It makes a good song.", "annotation_id": "15134965", "url": "https://genius.com/15134965", "state": "verified", "votes": 171, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Wasted", "line": "She be talkin’ to him when she in the matrix", "vault_lines": ["She be talkin' to him when she in the matrix"], "meaning": "I feel like when you get so high, some people get so high, that they just like in a different place, and I was just compare that to being in ‘The Matrix,’ and for the people that don’t know what ‘The Matrix’ is, you’re un-cultured. It’s one of the greatest movies of all time, I heard they started getting corny around like four though. I only saw the first one and the second one.", "annotation_id": "15134949", "url": "https://genius.com/15134949", "state": "verified", "votes": 80, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Wasted", "line": "She do cocaine in my basement", "vault_lines": ["She do cocaine in my basement"], "meaning": "I was just trying to create a visual image of kind of like suspicious activity, ‘cause you know, the next line, “She told me that she talking to Satan,” and it’s like, in my basement, so it’s sketchy type shit.", "annotation_id": "15134923", "url": "https://genius.com/15134923", "state": "verified", "votes": 73, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Wasted", "line": "Wasted, GTA love, bitches wasted Wasted, I’m on these drugs, I feel wasted Wasted, get her off my mind when I’m wasted Wasted, I waste all my time when I’m wasted Wasted, GTA love, bitches wasted Wasted, I’m on these drugs, I feel wasted Wasted, get her off my mind when I’m wasted Wasted, I waste all my time when I’m wasted, wasted", "vault_lines": ["Wasted, I waste all my time when I'm wasted, wasted"], "meaning": "When wasted first came in my head, obviously I was thinking about being fucked up, you know, like being lit. But then also the GTA thing, so I was just kind of tying different things in, back into the same concept.\n\nThe, “I waste all my time when I’m wasted” is like, when you get to a certain point of intoxication, you’re unable to operate, your motor skills become very out of pocket, so you’re unable to function, and if you’re not able to function, you’re wasting time.", "annotation_id": "15134916", "url": "https://genius.com/15134916", "state": "verified", "votes": 890, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Wasted", "line": "She been lacin’ all my drugs or somethin’ ’Cause every time that we’re together, I’m unconscious Hold up, uh, let me be honest I know I saw her put the Percs in my chronic", "vault_lines": ["Wasted, I waste all my time when I'm wasted, wasted"], "meaning": "Perc is slang for the prescription drug known as Percocet, which is a painkiller.\n\nChronic is a high-quality strain of weed, mainly characterized by red hairs. The term was popularized by Dr. Dre’s album of the same name.\n\nJuice WRLD claims that he saw his girlfriend lace his weed with Percocets, which happens to have  multiple side effects, such as nausea and unconsciousness.", "annotation_id": "15065793", "url": "https://genius.com/15065793", "state": "accepted", "votes": 59, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Wasted", "line": "Jacuzzi that booty, I gave that girl flakka", "vault_lines": ["Jacuzzi that booty, I gave that girl flakka"], "meaning": "Flakka is a  designer drug that can cause harmful effects such as hyperstimulation, paranoia, and hallucinations. The drug is also reported to be potentially more dangerous than cocaine.\n\nIn many countries, flakka is banned or controlled by the governments. It is reported to be available for around $3-$5 per dose. Colloquially, people call this drug “gravel” or “zombie drug”, because it can cause irrational behavior.\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=JIluJHg2S-s", "annotation_id": "15030388", "url": "https://genius.com/15030388", "state": "accepted", "votes": 27, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Wasted", "line": "No basic, brand new ‘Rari when I’m racin’ (Yeah)", "vault_lines": ["No basic, brand new 'Rari when I'm racin' (Yeah)"], "meaning": "Ferrari is an illustrious Italian sports car company established by Enzo Ferrari in 1939. Known for its impressive speed and majestic design, possession of the vehicle is a symbol of wealth and influence in the hip-hop community.\n\nhttps://www.instagram.com/p/BJGqoopDeBN/?taken-by=liluzivert&hl=en\nInstagram video commemorating Uzi’s Ferrari 458\n\n\nUzi boasts his superiority by comparing his swanky ride to the average automobile of the opponent, while spitting a similar line about the car in his 2016 track, “Run Up”:\n\nRacin’ this Rari like Mario Kart", "annotation_id": "14951465", "url": "https://genius.com/14951465", "state": "accepted", "votes": 24, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Wasted", "line": "Lil’ boy, I’m your father, hakuna matata", "vault_lines": ["Lil' boy, I'm your father, hakuna matata"], "meaning": "“Hakuna Matata” is Swahili for “no worries,” popularized by the 1994 Disney animation The Lion King.\n\nJames Earl Jones voices both Mufasa in The Lion King and Darth Vader in the Star Wars Trilogy; “Hakuna Matata” being a famous phrase from the former and “I am your father” from the latter. Uzi uses this to connect the two parts of this line that appear to be completely unrelated.\n\nLil Uzi Vert often refers to himself as the father of his songs and even other artists that are attempting to make similar music. He infers that he has fathered many rising artists and isn’t worried about the competition.", "annotation_id": "14950881", "url": "https://genius.com/14950881", "state": "accepted", "votes": 56, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Wasted", "line": "That’s the reason that I ride on my Appas", "vault_lines": ["That's the reason that I ride on my Appas"], "meaning": "Continuing the “Avatar: The Last Airbender” reference, Uzi compares himself to the TV show’s protagonist, Aang. In the show Aang often rides his loyal sky bison, Appa, to get around.\n\nThe delivery can also be interpreted as riding or pulling up to the opps, a slang for fighting against opposition.\n\nAdditionally, he could be playing on the word “uppers” – such as drugs like cocaine and MDMA.", "annotation_id": "14950677", "url": "https://genius.com/14950677", "state": "accepted", "votes": 124, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Wasted", "line": "I’m takin’ blue caps that keep tweakin’ my chakra", "vault_lines": ["I'm takin' blue caps that keep tweakin' my chakra"], "meaning": "Blue caps, short for capsules, likely refers to blue Adderall XR pills. The blue extended-release pill comes in varying strengths including 10 mg and 20 mg. Being a CNS stimulant, the drugs is known to treat ADHD and narcolepsy. The drug is often taken recreationally to induce feelings of euphoria and confidence.\n\nAlternatively, blue caps could refer to psilocybin mushrooms, which turn blue, typically after bruising or dehydration. Uzi’s experiences with psychedelic mushrooms likely increase his chakra, a type of spirituality popularized by Naruto. The chakra would then be used to create a Jutsus, or a type of spiritual spell, that would curse an enemy.\n\nThis would not be the first time Uzi has referenced Naruto. Starting the second verse of his September 2018 track, “New Patek,” Uzi makes a reference to the show:\n\nThrow up gang signs, Naruto (Uh)\nPut metal in my nose like Pain (Uh)", "annotation_id": "14949856", "url": "https://genius.com/14949856", "state": "accepted", "votes": 41, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Wasted", "line": "Rose on my chain, there’s no hint like no copper", "vault_lines": ["Rose on my chain, there's no hint like no copper"], "meaning": "Known for its marvelous color and shrouded rarity, rose gold is a pinkish-red alloy of gold.\n\nIn October 2017, Uzi created a chain to commemorate album Luv is Rage 2, the casing is solely rose gold:\n\n\n\nUzi refers to his chain when featuring in Travis Scott’s 2018 track, “Watch”:\n\nThe rose gold one better, hundred or better\n\nThis also alludes to the similarities between copper and rose gold, where the former is a cheap substitute for real gold. Uzi separates himself from this, stating his chain’s authenticity.", "annotation_id": "14949605", "url": "https://genius.com/14949605", "state": "accepted", "votes": 34, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Wasted", "line": "Rockstar, that’s our style, these boys can’t take it (Yeah)", "vault_lines": ["Rockstar, that's our style, these boys can't take it (Yeah)"], "meaning": "Uzi is a self-declared “rockstar,” often using the designation to illustrate his musical career, while jointly describing the difference between the old and new wave of hip-hop with the term.\n\nhttps://mobile.twitter.com/LILUZIVERT/status/725331530189541376?ref_src=twsrc%5Etwitterkit\n\nThe Philadelphian artist embraces this distinction while featuring in fellow collaborator Playboi Carti’s hit, “wokeuplikethis”:\n\nI’m a rockstar\nI’m a rockstar (Know I got a lot, lot)\nI’m a rockstar\n\nRockstar Games is also the gaming company that created the GTA series which Juice WRLD mentions in the chorus.", "annotation_id": "14949466", "url": "https://genius.com/14949466", "state": "accepted", "votes": 72, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Wasted", "line": "Tats in the middle my head like I’m Avatar", "vault_lines": ["Tats in the middle my head like I'm Avatar"], "meaning": "Uzi is referring to the character Aang from the animated series Avatar: The Last Airbender, who is the incarnation of the “Avatar”. Aang has a tattoo of an arrow in the middle of his head.\n\n\n\nLike Aang, Uzi has tattoos in the middle of his forehead.", "annotation_id": "14948690", "url": "https://genius.com/14948690", "state": "accepted", "votes": 85, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Wasted", "line": "I’m a doctor, but I’m runnin’ out of patience", "vault_lines": ["I'm a doctor, but I'm runnin' out of patience"], "meaning": "Juice WRLD uses a play on words, as “patience” and “patients” sound alike. By using the word “doctor,” Juice states that he cannot treat or take care of the woman anymore, therefore saying he is running out of patients.\n\nAdditonally, Juice WRLD stated in his video with Genius that this also refers to the fact that doctors have drugs:\n\nI believe that I don’t have any type of patience, so that’s why I kinda used the line “I’m a doctor,” meaning I have drugs but I don’t have patience.\n\nhttps://youtu.be/ivcKceGfmLE?si=kd_jNeWXLUtFDZyc&t=106", "annotation_id": "14948689", "url": "https://genius.com/14948689", "state": "accepted", "votes": 141, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
