{"type": "song", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Wassup Wit It", "status": "done", "targets": 0, "clicked": 0, "genius_url": "https://genius.com/Lil-uzi-vert-wassup-wit-it-lyrics", "genius_title": "Wassup Wit It", "genius_id": 11464076, "source": "api"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Wassup", "line": "Everybody know I am from outer space So you know that aliens be sendin’ me (Yeah)", "vault_lines": ["Everybody know I come from outer space"], "meaning": "Uzi often refers to himself as being from another planet. The theme of Eternal Atake is cosmic, as shown by the album cover art and the lore in his songs. Uzi tells the audience about his identity as an extraterrestrial in songs like Glock in my Purse (Red & White), Venetia (Eternal Atake), and The End (Pink Tape). In this lyric, Uzi portrays himself as having been sent from his home planet to Earth to live among humans.", "annotation_id": "40746974", "url": "https://genius.com/40746974", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Wassup", "line": "I fuck her three times, so I call that girl, um, a trinity (Woah, woah)", "vault_lines": ["I fuck her three times, so I call that girl, um, a trinity (Woah, woah)"], "meaning": "In Christian doctrine, the Trinity refers to God being three persons, the Father, the Son (Jesus), and the Holy Spirit, three people in one divine being.\n\nSince Lil Uzi Vert fucked his girl three times in one, that brings back the reference to the Trinity.", "annotation_id": "35609512", "url": "https://genius.com/35609512", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Wassup", "line": "Gettin’ too much money, I can build me a new facility (Lil Uzi Vert, yeah, yeah)", "vault_lines": ["Gettin' too much money, I can build me a new facility (Lil Uzi Vert, yeah, yeah)"], "meaning": "Uzi has always wanted to build his neighborhood, in a video where the youth talk about the future, a young symere talks about how he wants to build a community center with a garden and also about building his mom a house, it has come full circle.", "annotation_id": "34102043", "url": "https://genius.com/34102043", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Wassup", "line": "I remember livin’ right next to my enemy (Woah)", "vault_lines": ["I remember livin' right next to my enemy (Woah)"], "meaning": "I don’t know too much about this situation but in francisville Uzi was in a lot of trouble let’s say and the neighbor was so small everyone that was either friends or enemies lived on the same street, across, or up the road.", "annotation_id": "34102025", "url": "https://genius.com/34102025", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Wassup", "line": "They say, “How you keep all of that energy?”", "vault_lines": ["They say, \"How you keep all of that energy?\""], "meaning": "Vertical isn’t just a word! Lil Uzi Vert got his name from playing sports and rapping fast, he can lift more than his body weight, run a fast mile, and is good at combat sports. He’s also in his late 20s people are amazed that he is able to move like a teenager at times.", "annotation_id": "34102017", "url": "https://genius.com/34102017", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Wassup", "line": "And them three times that I had to take an L I remember them boys tried to finish me", "vault_lines": ["And them three times that I had to take an L"], "meaning": "Uzi lost 2 friends before the fame and infamously almost died, little is known about this altercation but it’s one of the reasons he moved with his grandmother.", "annotation_id": "34102011", "url": "https://genius.com/34102011", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Wassup", "line": "No, statistically, I can’t win every time But you know the score prolly like ten to three", "vault_lines": ["No, statistically, I can't win every time"], "meaning": "Uzi is referring to his beef W/L ratio.", "annotation_id": "34101999", "url": "https://genius.com/34101999", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
