{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Walking Dead", "line": "All this runway Gucci on me this shit look like Dapper Dan", "vault_lines": ["All this runway Gucci on me this shit look like Dapper Dan"], "meaning": "“Dapper Dan” refers to a Harlem-based fashion designer known for his custom-made clothing, often featuring luxury brands' logos and materials. When someone says “dis shit look like Dapper Dan,” they likely mean that something looks very stylish, high-end, or custom-made, reminiscent of Dapper Dan’s unique and luxurious designs.", "annotation_id": "32315564", "url": "https://genius.com/32315564", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
