{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Walking Around with a Bank", "line": "Told that bitch, “Get out my face” (Yeah) She pulled up and grabbed at my waist (Uh) Now I know what the bitch think (Yeah) Kill a nigga, leave the scene (Kill him) I’m in her mouth, Listerine (Mouth Listerine)", "vault_lines": ["She pulled up and grabbed at my waist (Uh)"], "meaning": "Uzi is flirting with a woman and tells her to get out of his face. Instead, she pulls in and grabs at his waist. Uzi is known to carry a pistol in his waistband so he playfully follows up with what her intentions could be with him.\n\nThankfully for Vert, she went for the other pistol in his pants, and he was excitedly in her mouth, Listerine.", "annotation_id": "33843740", "url": "https://genius.com/33843740", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Walking Around with a Bank", "line": "The money callin’ me (It callin’ me) The money stalkin’ me (It watchin’ me) The money talk to me (It talk to me) The money walk with me (It walk with me) I’m doin’ ballin’ things (I’m ballin’ baby) I’m doin’ ballin’ things (I’m ballin’ baby)", "vault_lines": ["The money callin' me (It callin' me)"], "meaning": "ya", "annotation_id": "25036458", "url": "https://genius.com/25036458", "state": "pending", "votes": -2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Walking Around with a Bank", "line": "Walkin’ around with a bank Walkin’ around with a bank Walkin’ around with a bank Walkin’ around with a bank Walkin’ around with a bank Walkin’ around with a bank Walkin’ around with a bank Walkin’ around with a bank", "vault_lines": ["Talkin' that shit, catch a fade (Fade)"], "meaning": "Lil Uzi is talking about how he walks around with so much money, it’s basically as much as a bank.", "annotation_id": "21398580", "url": "https://genius.com/21398580", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Walking Around with a Bank", "line": "Walkin’ around with a bank Walkin’ around with a bank Walkin’ around with a bank Walkin’ around with a bank Walkin’ around with a bank Walkin’ around with a bank Walkin’ around with a bank Walkin’ around with a bank", "vault_lines": ["Talkin' that shit, catch a fade (Fade)"], "meaning": "Lil Uzi is talking about how he walks around with so much money, it’s basically as much as a bank.\n\nThis also interpolates the lyrics from “Team Rocket”", "annotation_id": "21398574", "url": "https://genius.com/21398574", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Walking Around with a Bank", "line": "But them things fake (Fake) Calling ’em Falmain jeans", "vault_lines": ["But them things fake (Fake)"], "meaning": "Uzi’s Balmain is real but the same cannot be said for the subject of this line. Uzi refers to the fakes as Falmain, using the “f” from fake.", "annotation_id": "14502373", "url": "https://genius.com/14502373", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Walking Around with a Bank", "line": "Takin’ these Xans, I’ma fade (Fade)", "vault_lines": ["Takin' these Xans, I'ma fade (Fade)"], "meaning": "Uzi has expressed his use of prescription drug Xanax:\n\nhttps://twitter.com/liluzivert/status/678716190932516868?lang=en\n\nMost recently on his smash hit “XO TOUR Llif3” Uzi raps about using the drug to relive the pain of a relationship:\n\n“Xanny, help the pain, yeah\n Please, Xanny, make it go away”", "annotation_id": "12430584", "url": "https://genius.com/12430584", "state": "accepted", "votes": 9, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "song", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Walking Around with a Bank", "status": "done", "targets": 6, "clicked": 0, "genius_url": "https://genius.com/Lil-uzi-vert-walking-around-with-a-bank-lyrics", "genius_title": "Walking Around with a Bank", "genius_id": 3170356, "source": "api"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Walkin in Raf (Pet)", "line": "No Instagram (No Instagram), got a blue check (Got a blue check)", "vault_lines": ["No Instagram (No Instagram), got a blue check (Got a blue check)"], "meaning": "The Instagram Verified blue check is an emblem that serves as a reminder of one’s influence on the social media platform, belonging to reputable individuals in the rap world like Wiz Khalifa and Snoop Dogg.\n\nUzi boasts his huge popularity by claiming to be verified without the Instagram app.", "annotation_id": "14892936", "url": "https://genius.com/14892936", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Walkin in Raf (Pet)", "line": "I need a ’Vette (I need a ’Vette), uh, yeah, swerving that ’Vette, uh, yeah", "vault_lines": ["I need a 'Vette (I need a 'Vette), uh, yeah, swerving that 'Vette, uh, yeah"], "meaning": "“Vette” is a slang expression for the Chevrolet Corvette, a high-end sports car known for its sleek build and great acceleration.", "annotation_id": "14892874", "url": "https://genius.com/14892874", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Walkin in Raf (Pet)", "line": "VS diamonds in my teeth, they Colgate (’Gate)", "vault_lines": ["VS diamonds in my teeth, they Colgate ('Gate)"], "meaning": "V’s, short for Very Very Slightly Included (VVS) are a category of diamonds known for their clarity. The class of gemstone is known for its minute inclusions difficult for a skilled grader to spot under 10x magnification.\n\n\n\nUzi likens the shine of his diamond grill to the theoretical “shine” Colgate toothpaste gives one’s teeth.\n\nUzi’s has mentioned his VVSs in many of his songs, such as in his 2017 track, “For Real”;\n\nI’m on TV, with the VVs\nSo I 3-D’d my stones", "annotation_id": "14823126", "url": "https://genius.com/14823126", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Walkin in Raf (Pet)", "line": ".357 that shit hold the case (Case)", "vault_lines": [".357 that shit hold the case (Case)"], "meaning": "The .357 Smith and Wesson Magnum, a well-known successor of the .38 Special, is a deadly pistol and carbine cartridge designed by Elmer Keith in 1934. In the present day, the bullet is notorious for its use in several well known weapons, such as the Colt Single Action Army and the Ruger 77/22 rifle.", "annotation_id": "14818100", "url": "https://genius.com/14818100", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Walkin in Raf (Pet)", "line": "Got a iced out AP, got a Rollie dipped in gold", "vault_lines": ["Got a iced out AP, got a Rollie dipped in gold"], "meaning": "Audemars Piguet, commonly known as AP, is a prestigious luxury watch manufacturer based in La Brassus, Switzerland founded by Jules-Louis Audemars and Edward-Auguste Piguet in 1875. As diamonds are commonly known as “ice”, an iced out timepiece is covered in diamonds.\n\n\n\nRolex is yet another expensive luxury watch company out of Geneva, Switzerland. Founded in 1905 by Hans Wilsdorf, it is the largest and most distinguished watch establishment in the world.\n\n\n\nBy obtaining the likes of these magnificent watches, Uzi is alluding to his substantial wealth and power. The Philadelphia native has rapped about his Rolex many times in various songs, such as his 2016 track, “Grow Up” or in his feature in Travis Scott’s 2018 hit, “Watch”,\n\nLook at your Rollie, uh, look at my Rollie, uh\nThat’s a small face, uh, this a big face, uh", "annotation_id": "14817873", "url": "https://genius.com/14817873", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "song", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Walkin in Raf (Pet)", "status": "done", "targets": 5, "clicked": 0, "genius_url": "https://genius.com/Lil-uzi-vert-walkin-in-raf-pet-lyrics", "genius_title": "Walkin in Raf (Pet)", "genius_id": 3169052, "source": "api"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Walked Into Space", "line": "I got the Rari’ that’s on Ferris Bueller (Okay)", "vault_lines": ["I got the Rari' that's on Ferris Bueller (Okay)"], "meaning": "Uzi claims he got the Ferrari that’s seen in Ferris Bueller’s Day Off (1986). It’s a 1961 Ferrari 250 GT California Spyder.", "annotation_id": "39509525", "url": "https://genius.com/39509525", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
