{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Wait Up", "line": "I know you see me balling looking like [?] And when I hear money calling, that’s all I get into And when I hear the rain is pouring, so I got my hoodie too My chain is 3D, and my life is a movie too", "vault_lines": ["I know you see me balling looking like [?]"], "meaning": "this part was not on release", "annotation_id": "35987711", "url": "https://genius.com/35987711", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Wait Up", "line": "But if you hold me down, then I’m gonna hold you down But if my money is gone, would you still be around? I don’t know what you doin’ when I’m not around You don’t know what I’m doin’, when I’m out of town", "vault_lines": ["I know I'm livin' wrong (Wrong)"], "meaning": "this part was added to the first part of boogies first verse on the release version. and also added to the outro", "annotation_id": "35987697", "url": "https://genius.com/35987697", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
