{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Wait Up", "line": "And it’s VV gang pull up in a lemon coupe He got SI’s in this chain, he mixin’ up his jewels And you done fucked on my gang, so how I’m lovin’ you You cannot fuck up my name, so I’m not cuffin’ you", "vault_lines": ["And it's VV gang pull up in a lemon coupe"], "meaning": "this part of the hook was cut off the release hook but instead added as uzis short first verse on release", "annotation_id": "35987623", "url": "https://genius.com/35987623", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Wait Up", "line": "Just tell me when you wait up (Woah) Oh no, I cannot save her even though she is my favorite (Yeah) I hope I’m livin’ long (Long) I know I’m livin’ wrong (Wrong) Please don’t call me when I’m at home (No) You know I hit delete, my girl gon’ check my phone (Hello?) Like a small criminal (Yeah)", "vault_lines": ["She get upset when I don't post her"], "meaning": "these parts were cut off the release and the parts that are on release were changed to uzis last verse", "annotation_id": "35987610", "url": "https://genius.com/35987610", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Wait Up", "line": "The last time I fucked you, you was mad I was drippin’ lotion on your body and your ass Bought you a whole bunch of fly shit so you can brag And when your friends talk about me, you be so mad But, you know my body, girl, you know me You know my body, girl, you know me Yeah, yeah, you already felt it And I already seen you naked, but girl don’t make me wait up", "vault_lines": ["I was drippin' lotion on your body and your ass"], "meaning": "these lines were used as the first verse on the release version", "annotation_id": "35987589", "url": "https://genius.com/35987589", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
