{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Vibe*", "line": "Vetti", "vault_lines": ["Got two inside in a Vetti"], "meaning": "Uzi is referring to the Lamborghini Aventador A high-performance Italian supercar produced by Lamborghini. It’s known for its aggressive design, extremely powerful V12 engine, and very fast acceleration.", "annotation_id": "40148396", "url": "https://genius.com/40148396", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
