{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Vetements Jeans", "line": ", I been touching on myself", "vault_lines": [", yeah, I been touching on myself"], "meaning": "When doing ecstasy, molly, or mdma, Carti and Uzi like to masterbate during these sessions, most likely to increase the pleasure from doing these drugs.", "annotation_id": "32874397", "url": "https://genius.com/32874397", "state": "pending", "votes": 10, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
