{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Vetements Jeans", "line": "I’m copping the pink Mary, yeah-yeah, drove here by myself", "vault_lines": ["I'm copping the pink Mary, yeah-yeah, drove here by myself"], "meaning": "In the lyrics “I’m copping the pink Mary, yeah-yeah, drove here by myself,” Playboi Carti is referring to him purchasing “pink Mary.” In this context, “Mary” is often a slang term for marijuana or a specific strain of cannabis.", "annotation_id": "30343267", "url": "https://genius.com/30343267", "state": "pending", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Vetements Jeans", "line": "I’m off the E-E", "vault_lines": ["I'm off the E-E"], "meaning": "The term “E” is a slang abbreviation for ecstasy. The line “I’m off the E-E, yeah” suggests that the speaker is under the influence of ecstasy.", "annotation_id": "30343237", "url": "https://genius.com/30343237", "state": "pending", "votes": 6, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
