{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Vetements Jeans", "line": "SRT", "vault_lines": ["Uh, went to sleep, huh, yeah, woke up with a bag"], "meaning": "SRT is the performance line of Dodge. Some of there most notable cars include the Gen 5 Viper, Challenger & Charger SRT Hellcat, Challenger & Charger SRT Scat Pack, Challenger & Charger SRT 392, and limited edition variants of these models.", "annotation_id": "29775901", "url": "https://genius.com/29775901", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
