{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Venetia", "line": "Every time I have a show, gotta sell it out ’fore I go to sleep", "vault_lines": ["Every time I have a show, gotta sell it out 'fore I go to sleep"], "meaning": "Uzi is talkin bout the thrill of bein an artist: when he allows fans to cop tickets to his shows, he has to watch people cop all of the tickets before he ends his day. This is important because he has probably watched the show sell out before he went to sleep before, so now this is how he gauges whether his fans still fuck with him", "annotation_id": "21972912", "url": "https://genius.com/21972912", "state": "pending", "votes": 6, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Venetia", "line": "Lil Uzi Vert, to be exact (Oh)", "vault_lines": ["And I'm not from earth, I'm from outer space (Woah, let's go)"], "meaning": "Lil Uzi Vert", "annotation_id": "20398350", "url": "https://genius.com/20398350", "state": "pending", "votes": 70, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Venetia", "line": "I never, ever tell on my niggas, I don’t care if they give me third degree (Fuck ’em)", "vault_lines": ["I never, ever tell on my niggas, I don't care if they give me third degree (Fuck 'em)"], "meaning": "The third degree is an American euphemism for long and harsh interrogation, especially by the police, to obtain information or a confession. Third degree interrogation is known to be consisting of torture methods and is usually frowned upon for that reason. Despite this, third degree interrogation is still occasionally used today.", "annotation_id": "19546284", "url": "https://genius.com/19546284", "state": "accepted", "votes": 13, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Venetia", "line": "I done did everything, ain’t do no crack cocaine, yeah, yeah", "vault_lines": ["I done did everything, ain't do no crack cocaine, yeah, yeah"], "meaning": "This could be a reference to G Herbo’s song “Everything”, which Uzi is featured on. In this song, G Herbo raps a similar line:\n\nI done tried everything, except coke and dope", "annotation_id": "19234499", "url": "https://genius.com/19234499", "state": "accepted", "votes": 20, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Venetia", "line": "I’m always gon’ be a 1600 nigga with money connecting the streets (Yeah, yeah)", "vault_lines": ["I'm always gon' be a 1600 nigga with money connecting the streets (Yeah, yeah)"], "meaning": "Lil Uzi is from Philadelphia, Pennsylvania, where he grew up on the 1600 block of North Philly.\n\nhttps://twitter.com/LILUZIVERT/status/836352529764139009\n\nUzi has referenced his hometown in his music many times before, which can be seen on his August 2017 track “Dark Queen”:\n\nDear mama (Slatt, 1600 block)\nLove you mama (That’s on gang, slatt)\nAnd grandmama (1600 block)", "annotation_id": "19221674", "url": "https://genius.com/19221674", "state": "accepted", "votes": 32, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Venetia", "line": "Louis V everything, I got the taste", "vault_lines": ["Louis V everything, I got the taste"], "meaning": "Fashion is of particular to Lil Uzi, so much so that he’s explained that he’s more passionate about fashion than music. Self proclaimed, No Stylist, Uzi simultaneously breaks and defines menswear.\n\nIn this line, Uzi expresses his great love for Louis Vuitton and wearing head to toe LV outfits. On several occasions, Uzi has been seen dressed in completely Louis Vuitton.\nhttps://www.instagram.com/p/B4ErXXAgFN1/?utm_source=ig_embed\nLil Uzi dressed in a complete LV fit at the Sixers v Celtics game in November 2019\n\n\n\nUzi shows off a complete LV fit including the Louis Vuitton Earbuds.\n\n\n\nUzi dressed in head to toe LV outside a Louis Vuitton office.", "annotation_id": "19220355", "url": "https://genius.com/19220355", "state": "pending", "votes": 9, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Venetia", "line": "And she will suck on this dick if she old enough to vote, yeah, yeah", "vault_lines": ["And she will suck on this dick if she old enough to vote, yeah, yeah"], "meaning": "The age to vote in the United States is 18, the official age of adulthood. It is also the age of consent in most states. As a 25 year old, Lil Uzi can not legally have anyone younger than 18 suck his dick, but anyone of that age is fair game.", "annotation_id": "19219297", "url": "https://genius.com/19219297", "state": "pending", "votes": 61, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Venetia", "line": "Spanish girl, she always tryna get my pesos (Woo)", "vault_lines": ["Spanish girl, she always tryna get my pesos (Woo)"], "meaning": "The Peso is the monetary unit of several Spanish speaking countries including Argentina, Chile, Colombia, Cuba, the Dominican Republic, Mexico, and Uruguay. Thus, the Spanish girl in this line is trying to get Uzi’s money.", "annotation_id": "19219268", "url": "https://genius.com/19219268", "state": "accepted", "votes": 17, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Venetia", "line": "I can make a gay girl turn to a straight", "vault_lines": ["I can make a gay girl turn to a straight"], "meaning": "Uzi bolsters himself by claiming that his personality, charm, and wealth can cause a homosexual woman to become heterosexual. He made a similar claim on his November 2016 track, “IN O4',” rapping:\n\nYeah, that girl told me she only fuck with them girls\nThen I pulled out my ice\nOkay, now I fucked her, now she half a dyke", "annotation_id": "19218458", "url": "https://genius.com/19218458", "state": "accepted", "votes": 48, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Venetia", "line": "Talk to the reverend, but I don’t know Ma$e", "vault_lines": ["Talk to the reverend, but I don't know Ma$e"], "meaning": "Ma$e is an East Coast rapper who became well-known during the late 1990’s for his affiliation with Bad Boy Entertainment and its head honcho, fellow rapper Puff Daddy, as well as a string of hits including “Feel So Good,” “What You Want,” and The Notorious B.I.G.’s “Mo' Money Mo' Problems.”\n\nHowever, Mase decided to temporarily abandon hip-hop and become a pastor at the peak of his career, right before the turn of the century. Mase has since returned to rapping.", "annotation_id": "19217967", "url": "https://genius.com/19217967", "state": "accepted", "votes": 31, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Venetia", "line": "She want all that verde, but pockets azul (Azul, azul)", "vault_lines": ["She want all that verde, but pockets azul (Azul, azul)"], "meaning": "Verde is Spanish for green. Uzi is saying she can’t get any green because all he has are hundred dollar bills that are blue (Azul).", "annotation_id": "19217329", "url": "https://genius.com/19217329", "state": "pending", "votes": 56, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Venetia", "line": "All orange on me, baby, orange, yeah, look like Tang, yeah, yeah", "vault_lines": ["All orange on me, baby, orange, yeah, look like Tang, yeah, yeah"], "meaning": "On January 5, 2020 Lil Uzi Vert dyed his hair orange and shared its meaning via a series of tweets.\n\nhttps://twitter.com/LILUZIVERT/status/1213955632652603398?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw\n\n\n \n\nhttps://twitter.com/LILUZIVERT/status/1213996183460491269?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw\n\n\n \n\nUzi says he look like “Tang”, which is an orange colored drink.", "annotation_id": "19217067", "url": "https://genius.com/19217067", "state": "accepted", "votes": 31, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Venetia", "line": "Treatin’ these Diors like it’s just old Vans, yeah, yeah", "vault_lines": ["Treatin' these Diors like it's just old Vans, yeah, yeah"], "meaning": "Christian Dior SE is a French luxury goods company, mainly selling expensive designer clothes.\n\nCompared to Dior, Vans is an American name brand that tends to sell low priced skateboarding shoes, which usually get dirty or scuffed up with skating.", "annotation_id": "19216574", "url": "https://genius.com/19216574", "state": "accepted", "votes": 39, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
