{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Urgency", "line": "Treat my darkskin like my redbone, yeah Tell my redbone call my red phone It’s emergency I hit you up just with that urgency", "vault_lines": ["Treat my darkskin like my redbone, yeah"], "meaning": "The term redbone refers to a light-skinned (mixed race, a black and white offspring) person. Lil Uzi is saying he’s equal with how he treats his girls. Hittin' up his light-skin girl for an emergency booty call.\n\nThese lines also serve as reference and a sequel to his 2017 song “20 Min” where Uzi sang:\n\nShe call my phone with emergency (Ayy)\nShe call my phone with that urgency (Ayy)", "annotation_id": "19223431", "url": "https://genius.com/19223431", "state": "accepted", "votes": 50, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Urgency", "line": "Keep on tryna take my persona (Huh?) Bite me up like a piranha (Bite)", "vault_lines": ["Keep on tryna take my persona (Huh?)"], "meaning": "As one of the biggest names in modern hip-hop, Uzi has helped bring popularity to emo rap and has become an inspiration for many rappers who thus attempt to copy (or bite) their style.\n\nPiranhas have razor-sharp teeth which are capable of tearing flesh from the bone when biting.", "annotation_id": "19220520", "url": "https://genius.com/19220520", "state": "accepted", "votes": 33, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Urgency", "line": "I’m outside in the black truck, jump in", "vault_lines": ["I'm outside in the black truck, jump in"], "meaning": "Syd references Uzi’s Rhino GX here.\n\n\n\nUzi is known to have bought the Rhino GX in August 2018. https://twitter.com/rapallstars/status/1026701688407842816?lang=en\n\nOther notable artists have bought the Rhino GX including 2 Chainz and the late XXXTentacion.", "annotation_id": "19220078", "url": "https://genius.com/19220078", "state": "pending", "votes": 7, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
