{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Uppin Downers (SoundCloud Rappers Only)", "line": "She was on Roxy and E", "vault_lines": ["She was on Roxy and E"], "meaning": "Roxi is slang for Roxicontin, which is a term for the opiate-derived pain killer oxycodone.\n\nE is slang for Ecstasy. Ecstasy is a central stimulant synthetic drug similar to amphetamine and the hallucinogenic drug mescaline.", "annotation_id": "24512131", "url": "https://genius.com/24512131", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
