{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Uppin Downers (SoundCloud Rappers Only)", "line": "All of my diamonds, they start with V", "vault_lines": ["All of my diamonds, they start with V"], "meaning": "V is referring to VVS, which stands for Very Very Slight, referring to the clarity of the diamonds. VVS diamonds are more expensive and more rare, so Uzi is flexing by saying all of his diamonds are VVS’s.", "annotation_id": "20300133", "url": "https://genius.com/20300133", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
