{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Uppin Downers (SoundCloud Rappers Only)", "line": "(Damn, DJ Plugg, you just killed it)", "vault_lines": ["I don't wanna go if it's not no pills there (No)"], "meaning": "The producer tag for DJ Plugg. He has produced other tracks for the Migos, Rich Homie Quan, Future, as well as Lil Uzi Vert.\n\n\n\nHis other collaborations with Uzi include “Belly” from Luv Is Rage, “LUV SCARS K.o 1600” from Luv Is Rage 1.5, and “For Real” from Luv Is Rage 2.", "annotation_id": "13147183", "url": "https://genius.com/13147183", "state": "accepted", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Uppin Downers (SoundCloud Rappers Only)", "line": "Fuck that bih once, then I dip Fuck that bih once, then I dip Fuck that bih once, then I dip Fuck that bih once, then I dip Fuck the bitch once (Hey), then I hit delete", "vault_lines": ["Fuck that bih once, then I dip"], "meaning": "“Dip” means to suddenly leave. Uzi uses this term and also “delete” to show that he’s interested in this girl only to have intercourse with her for one night and that he’s not planning to start a relationship.", "annotation_id": "12668212", "url": "https://genius.com/12668212", "state": "accepted", "votes": 6, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Uppin Downers (SoundCloud Rappers Only)", "line": "Still the same nigga, eat my salmon blackened", "vault_lines": ["Still the same nigga, eat my salmon blackened"], "meaning": "Blackened salmon is a way to cook salmon or any type of meat by singeing the outside and leaving the inside tender. Since its considered one of the more premier cooking techniques, Uzi is expressing that he still is enjoying the lavish “rockstar” lifestyle ever since his mainstream popularity and nothing has changed for him ever since then.\n\nThis line is echoed from Uzi’s earlier hit, “Money Longer” which was also the third track off of his second commercial mixtape, Lil Uzi Vert vs. The World.\n\nAll of this is faction, no time for actin', all this money lastin'\nLike go out to eat, get that blackened salmon", "annotation_id": "12668074", "url": "https://genius.com/12668074", "state": "accepted", "votes": 5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Uppin Downers (SoundCloud Rappers Only)", "line": "I take Addy just to keep me up (Yeah) I take Xanny just to bring me down", "vault_lines": ["I was on Addy to keep me up"], "meaning": "Uzi is mixing up the medicine using (Adderall), a prescription stimulant for ADD that is used to elevate and increase energy and focus.  Uzi takes the Adderall to keep him awake, but uses the Xans to calm from the hyperactivity and feelings of  anxiety — some side effects caused by taking Adderall.\n\nLil Uzi has frequently mentioned popping Xans—amongst other drugs—like on “Money Longer,” “Safe House,” and “Canadian Goose.”\n\n Adderall can also cause blurred vision.", "annotation_id": "11268239", "url": "https://genius.com/11268239", "state": "accepted", "votes": 13, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
