{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Understand", "line": "I understand that next year, I’ll be XXL (I will, I will)", "vault_lines": ["I understand that next year, I'll be XXL (I will, I will)"], "meaning": "Uzi aspires to be on the XXL Freshman list – a yearly list that features ten artists on the rise showcasing their talent through cypers and solo freestyles. They also feature all ten picks on the cover of the magazine issue specifically about them. The 2015 class consisted of Fetty Wap, DeJ Loaf, Raury, Kidd Kidd, OG Maco, Shy Glizzy, K Camp, Vince Staples, Tink, and GoldLink.", "annotation_id": "8300812", "url": "https://genius.com/8300812", "state": "accepted", "votes": 10, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
