{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Trappin’ In Fashion", "line": "Spanish girl, maricón", "vault_lines": ["Me and Swae in this bitch, baby"], "meaning": "“Maricon” when translated to English, reads:\n\nF*ggot\n\nA sort of fun shot at himself, since the beginning of his career, Uzi has been pushing the limits of what the public sees as “Normal” fashion, usually getting himself tons of comments on how he looks “feminine” or “gay”. This is Uzi acknowledging these comments, but as we continue to see him in media, he clearly does not care and continues to do him.", "annotation_id": "39775164", "url": "https://genius.com/39775164", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
