{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Trap This Way (This Way)", "line": "Plug from Medellin", "vault_lines": ["In the club, plug from Medellin"], "meaning": "Medellín is the second largest city in the country of Colombia. In the 80s, it was notorious due to being a warzone for drug cartels. However, crime has dramatically decreased over the past couple of decades.", "annotation_id": "31579686", "url": "https://genius.com/31579686", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Trap This Way (This Way)", "line": "Make it vibrate seven-hundred thirty minutes (Yeah) Make it vibrate seven-hundred thirty minutes (Huh) Make it vibrate seven-hundred thirty minutes (Huh)", "vault_lines": ["Make it vibrate seven-hundred thirty minutes (Yeah)"], "meaning": "Uzi is saying they are going to stimulate this woman for 12 hours and 10 minutes. In that time, you could listen to the entire tracklist of the deluxe (including the original songs from EA) about seven times.", "annotation_id": "31579609", "url": "https://genius.com/31579609", "state": "pending", "votes": 9, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Trap This Way (This Way)", "line": "Said she’s DTF for tickets to the show (Yeah)", "vault_lines": ["Said she's DTF for tickets to the show (Yeah)"], "meaning": "DTF- Down To Fuck", "annotation_id": "25239860", "url": "https://genius.com/25239860", "state": "pending", "votes": 11, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Trap This Way (This Way)", "line": "Gucci on me, head-to-toe, I swear this shit is linen", "vault_lines": ["Gucci on me, head-to-toe, I swear this shit is linen"], "meaning": "Gucci is a high-end designer brand founded in 1921 by Guccio Gucci.\n\nThroughout hip-hop’s decade of 2010-2020, Gucci had been named-dropped the most out of any other brand in the world, beating Mercedes-Benz by one-hundred mentions.\n\nUzi flaunts that his body is covered in Gucci garments which consist of a linen material, which is more-expensive than cotton as it is thirty percent more durable which adds on to the initial flex.\n\nUzi has previously shown his taste for the brand in his un-released track entitled “Get It”, in which the chorus he raps:\n\nTurn around, bitch, let me hit it, uh\nI'ma do it in my Gucci linen, uh\nI'ma do it in my Gucci linen\nYoung nigga, you know I ain’t scared to spend it\n\n\n\nUzi wearing a Gucci Wool Bear Cardigan.", "annotation_id": "19283940", "url": "https://genius.com/19283940", "state": "accepted", "votes": 12, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
