{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Too Much Sauce", "line": "Yeah, all of my diamonds they shine Haters like “knock that off” Yeah, all of your diamonds are fake Need to stop that dawg", "vault_lines": ["Haters like \"knock that off\""], "meaning": "Despite only recently blowing up, Vert is already indulging in expensive jewellery.\n\n\n\n“Knock that off” is a play on “knock off,” or fake diamonds. His enemies end up on the Instagram page “fakewatchbusta,” rocking cheap knock off’s.", "annotation_id": "9818634", "url": "https://genius.com/9818634", "state": "accepted", "votes": 29, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Too Much Sauce", "line": "Young man, young man Young man turned myself right to a boss like yeah", "vault_lines": ["Young man, young man"], "meaning": "Uzi pays homage to his partner Future by referencing his track “Made Myself a Boss” off his 2011 mixtape Streetz Calling. and by using the flow off of his 2015 hit “Jumpman”.\n\nUzi can relate to the subject of the song as he’s one of the upcoming rappers and was featured on 2016’s XXL Freshman Cover.\n.", "annotation_id": "9818077", "url": "https://genius.com/9818077", "state": "accepted", "votes": 16, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Too Much Sauce", "line": "Drugs got me lost like Bermuda", "vault_lines": ["Drugs got me lost like Bermuda"], "meaning": "Uzi’s mind is lost off the drugs that he is on like Xanax and weed. The Bermuda Triangle is a location in the Atlantic Ocean where a variety of planes and ships have disappeared. Lil Uzi references this to show how faded he is.", "annotation_id": "9808803", "url": "https://genius.com/9808803", "state": "accepted", "votes": 40, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Too Much Sauce", "line": "Think me and Future fucked on the same twins Damn, yeah, wait", "vault_lines": ["Think me and Future fucked on the same twins"], "meaning": "Uzi could be referring to the twins he mentions on “Hi Roller” from Lil Uzi Vert vs The World, as well as those on Future’s track “Real Sisters” from his album DS2 and the earlier mixtape it was first included on; Beast Mode:\n\nFuck around with me, you tryna dodge bullets\nFuck around with me, I fuck twin sisters", "annotation_id": "9763354", "url": "https://genius.com/9763354", "state": "accepted", "votes": 24, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Too Much Sauce", "line": "Rockin’ VLONE when I’m rockin’ Off-White That’s too much sauce", "vault_lines": ["That's too much sauce"], "meaning": "Uzi rocks streetwear brands VLONE and Off-white along with his designer gear like Goyard.\n\nThe two brands recently collaborated.", "annotation_id": "9761789", "url": "https://genius.com/9761789", "state": "accepted", "votes": 34, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Too Much Sauce", "line": "Diamonds they look like Dasani huh, more like Voss, ayy", "vault_lines": ["Diamonds they look like Dasani huh, more like Voss, ayy"], "meaning": "Uzi compares the clarity of his diamonds to two popular brands of water in this line. Voss Water is more expensive than Dasani, meaning Uzi only wears the highest quality diamonds (VVS).", "annotation_id": "9761728", "url": "https://genius.com/9761728", "state": "accepted", "votes": 74, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Too Much Sauce", "line": "Patek Philippe, the plain one, that’s too much sauce", "vault_lines": ["Patek Philippe, the plain one, that's too much sauce"], "meaning": "Patek Philippe & Co. (PP) is a Swiss watch maker. “The plain one” either refers to a model unadorned by diamonds or extra bling, or simply a plain model, like the no nonsense 5496P-015.\n\n\n\nAs always, if you have to ask, it’s probably “too much sauce,” but a plain Patek Philippe watch can set you back $100k.", "annotation_id": "9761704", "url": "https://genius.com/9761704", "state": "accepted", "votes": 63, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Too Much Sauce", "line": "Audemars, Hublot now, that’s too much sauce That’s too much sauce, got too much sauce That’s too much sauce, I got too much sauce", "vault_lines": ["That's too much sauce"], "meaning": "Audemars and Hublot are two of Future’s favorite luxury watches to shout out, and they cost a mint. Let’s hope he’s not purchasing fake watches.", "annotation_id": "9761600", "url": "https://genius.com/9761600", "state": "accepted", "votes": 41, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Too Much Sauce", "line": "Hermes in the A, that’s too much sauce", "vault_lines": ["Hermes in the A, that's too much sauce"], "meaning": "Hermes has a store in Atlanta at Buckhead Atlanta that opened in 2014.\n\n\n\nEven the cheapest Herme’s bags cost around 10,000 Euros ($10583.50).", "annotation_id": "9761591", "url": "https://genius.com/9761591", "state": "accepted", "votes": 35, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Too Much Sauce", "line": "Shaquille O’Neal with the haters cause I’m blockin’ y’all", "vault_lines": ["Shaquille O'Neal with the haters cause I'm blockin' y'all"], "meaning": "Though Shaq recorded over 2,700 blocks in his career, he never led the league in the stat, making somebody like Dikembe Mutombo a more likely reference for this line.", "annotation_id": "9761526", "url": "https://genius.com/9761526", "state": "accepted", "votes": 44, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
