{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Tony The Tiger", "line": "Her pussy ain’t dry like a raisin, it’s more like a grape, yeah (More like a grape, yeah)", "vault_lines": ["Her pussy ain't dry like a raisin, it's more like a grape, yeah (More like a grape, yeah)"], "meaning": "Uzi says that his girl’s pussy is not dry like a raisin (a grape that has been dehydrated) but more like a grape (an undehydrated raisin)", "annotation_id": "35844222", "url": "https://genius.com/35844222", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Tony The Tiger", "line": "I don’t wear no Marni no more, that shit look just like Bape, yeah (Look just like Bape, yeah)", "vault_lines": ["I don't wear no Marni no more, that shit look just like Bape, yeah (Look just like Bape, yeah)"], "meaning": "Uzi says that the clothing brand Marni, is so overworn that it is now at the same level as of Bape, another clothing brand popular in the 2016-2018 era due to its signature shark logo. Bape could be found everywhere with youtubers rockin them to middle school hypebeasts who used their mom’s credit card wearing them to 2nd period math class. As such, Uzi says Marni is now so overworn by everyone that he can’t associate with the brand anymore", "annotation_id": "35844216", "url": "https://genius.com/35844216", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Tony The Tiger", "line": "How you gonna save that lil’ bitch and you don’t got a cape, yeah? (Huh)", "vault_lines": ["How you gonna save that lil' bitch and you don't got a cape, yeah? (Huh)"], "meaning": "Uzi takes aim at his opps by saying “How you gonna save that lil' bitch and you don’t got a cape”. What Uzi means in this verse is that his opps are tryna save girls that are in need of saving (taking out of the hood), however, these people themselves aren’t even akin to that of superheroes hence how could they save them", "annotation_id": "35844213", "url": "https://genius.com/35844213", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
