{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Tone", "line": "Poppin’ them Lilo’s, I’m done with the Stitch", "vault_lines": ["Poppin' them Lilo's, I'm done with the Stitch"], "meaning": "Uzi flips the Disney film title characters, Lilo & Stitch, into a metaphor for drugs and heartbreak.\n\nLilo is used as a stand-in for pills, while Stitch implies that he’s cutting ties with someone or something that used to hold him together.", "annotation_id": "37662809", "url": "https://genius.com/37662809", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
