{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Today!!", "line": "I play with her kitty like hello (Whoo)", "vault_lines": ["I play with her kitty like hello (Whoo)"], "meaning": "Uzi is referencing character Hello Kitty created by japanese company Sanrio", "annotation_id": "32113648", "url": "https://genius.com/32113648", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Today!!", "line": "Driving in the Lamb but I’ma get the Wraith, yeah", "vault_lines": ["Driving in the Lamb but I'ma get the Wraith, yeah"], "meaning": "Lamborghini is an illustrious Italian luxury sports car manufacturer loved by many in the rap game, such as Nicki Minaj, Chris Brown, and Yo Gotti.\n\n\n\n\n\nThe “Wraith” is a reference to Rolls-Royce’s Wraith, a dynamic addition to Rolls-Royce’s prestigious line of luxury cars. Uzi references the Wraith to emphasize the amount of cash he has, but is also addressing his love for the car company itself, just as he has done in other tracks like Playboi Carti’s “wokeuplikethis*” in which Uzi voiced,\n\nNo I cannot see a lame ‘cause my Rolls Royce got curtains", "annotation_id": "14783981", "url": "https://genius.com/14783981", "state": "accepted", "votes": 5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Today!!", "line": "Colors and chains look like Bape (Brrr!)", "vault_lines": ["Colors and chains look like Bape (Brrr!)"], "meaning": "Uzi’s talking about Nigo, the founder of Japanese clothing brand Bape, who was notorious for his huge, expensive, colorful diamond chains.\n\n\n\nNow, Uzi is becoming known for his expensive, colorful iced out jewelry, just as Nigo was.\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=f7Cux6hJrYU\n\nAlso, Pharrell, who is one of Nigo’s best friends, has a chain who’s links are very similar to Uzi’s new chain.", "annotation_id": "10950737", "url": "https://genius.com/10950737", "state": "pending", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Today!!", "line": "Flowers on that Murakami and petal", "vault_lines": ["Flowers on that Murakami and petal"], "meaning": "This could be a reference to the Japanese designer Takashi Murakami, who did a collaboration with vans. His designs are colourful and some have flowers in them. He also references Murakami in the song ‘buy it’", "annotation_id": "10904354", "url": "https://genius.com/10904354", "state": "pending", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
