{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Tipton*", "line": "Shout out Grimes, Neuralink got me bl-e-e-d-ing", "vault_lines": ["Shout out Grimes, Neuralink got me bl-e-e-d-ing"], "meaning": "Grimes is an ex-girlfriend of Elon Musk, and he is the founder of Neuralink, a company that was made to help people with paralysis communicate by allowing them to remotely control devices using brain activity.\n\nThe Neuralink procedure involves removing a portion of the skull, and implanting the brian with a coin-sized device which would cause bleeding.", "annotation_id": "33922432", "url": "https://genius.com/33922432", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
