{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Threesome", "line": "Yeah, pescatarian, but I order my niggas like three steaks", "vault_lines": ["Yeah, pescatarian, but I order my niggas like three steaks"], "meaning": "Although Uzi is pescatarian, he has enough money to buy steaks for his gang.\n\nUzi has also mentioned his unique diet on tracks like “Diamonds All on My Wrist”:\n\nYeah I put shrimp on my dinner plate\n\nand “Do What I Want”:\n\nHunt & Fish Club where I’m eatin', woah, what’s for lunch?\n\nUzi has publicly mentioned his seafood diet on twitter:\nhttps://twitter.com/liluzivert/status/918941462649192448?lang=en", "annotation_id": "13593506", "url": "https://genius.com/13593506", "state": "accepted", "votes": 7, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
