{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Thot Back", "line": "I don’t know if it was good, hit her off the Perc’ (Perc’, perc’)", "vault_lines": ["I don't know if it was good, hit her off the Perc' (Perc', perc')"], "meaning": "In this line Uzi is talking about the sex he just had with a woman. He is saying he does not even know if it was good sex because he had taken a percocet prior to having intercourse. Oxycodone (most commonly known as a Percocet) is a opioid that is used for severe pain relief. The side effects that Uzi is feeling in this line from taking a Percocet are euphoria and relaxation.", "annotation_id": "28754578", "url": "https://genius.com/28754578", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
