{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Thot Back", "line": "Yeah, give me brain, turn me right to a nerd (Nerd), ayy", "vault_lines": ["Yeah, give me brain, turn me right to a nerd (Nerd), ayy"], "meaning": "The term “brain”, is used to describe what is known as oral sex in slang, since it is apart of the head, just like the mouth which is used for oral sex. The brain is the largest organ in the head of a human-being.\n\nUzi is comparing the brain from oral sex he receives to the brain of a nerd; a social outcast who has a high degree of intelligence presumably.", "annotation_id": "24700217", "url": "https://genius.com/24700217", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Thot Back", "line": "Runnin’ bands up, I get ’em pronto (Bee)", "vault_lines": ["Runnin' bands up, I get 'em pronto (Bee)"], "meaning": "Pronto means “Done” in Spanish and Portuguese. Ballout means he gets his bands (money) done.", "annotation_id": "24624377", "url": "https://genius.com/24624377", "state": "pending", "votes": 5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Thot Back", "line": "I’m already done, can have your thot back", "vault_lines": ["I'm already done, can have your thot back"], "meaning": "Uzi is saying that the partner of the girl he was having affairs (presumably a man) with was just told him she was cheating on him behind his back, but doesn’t want to continue his actions as he’s already moved on from her.", "annotation_id": "24503056", "url": "https://genius.com/24503056", "state": "pending", "votes": 8, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Thot Back", "line": "In the Hellcat, blue hunchos (Skrr)", "vault_lines": ["In the Hellcat, blue hunchos (Skrr)"], "meaning": "“the Hellcat” is a car produced by Dodge. It is very similar to the Charger, and it’s formal name is “Dodge Charger SRT Hellcat Redeye”\n\n\n\nIt was reported that Ballout’s Hellcat was taken by the police, but there was not much more information released about the incident.", "annotation_id": "22554808", "url": "https://genius.com/22554808", "state": "pending", "votes": 8, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Thot Back", "line": "Thirty boppers, got them choppers like the purge", "vault_lines": ["Thirty boppers, got them choppers like the purge"], "meaning": "“The Purge” is a series of thriller movies where the US celebrates a holiday that legalizes all crime for 12 hours.\n\nUzi is saying he’s prepared with guns as if everyone’s out to get him.", "annotation_id": "20032280", "url": "https://genius.com/20032280", "state": "pending", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Thot Back", "line": "I ain’t worried ’bout it, bitch, I got racks (Yeah), ooh", "vault_lines": ["I ain't worried 'bout it, bitch, I got racks (Yeah), ooh"], "meaning": "Uzi states in this line that he’s not worried if his girl leaves him because he still has his money, which is not leaving any time soon.\n\nHe kept the same mindset on “That’s on You” by Rambo Savage.\n\nBitches come and go but my money stay (Stay)\n\nAlso he might be referring to when he had a one-night stand with Brittany Renner and when she found out about him not trying to be more than friends with her, she tried to expose him for it.", "annotation_id": "16036804", "url": "https://genius.com/16036804", "state": "accepted", "votes": 11, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Thot Back", "line": "Brand-new foreign, ooh, digi-dash, hit the swerve (Swerve)", "vault_lines": ["Brand-new foreign, ooh, digi-dash, hit the swerve (Swerve)"], "meaning": "Lil Uzi is flexing by conveying that he gets so much money to buy expenseive cars like ‘foreigns’ which is slang for referring cars from Europe (Mercedes, BMW, VW, Lamborghini), because they are usually luxury cars and therefore expensive as well.\nhttps://www.urbandictionary.com/define.php?term=Foreign\n\n\n\nHe, in fact, does own a ‘foreign’ a Lamborghini Huracán.\nhttps://www.instagram.com/p/BLwPdWKDlCG/?hl=en&taken-by=liluzivert", "annotation_id": "13563852", "url": "https://genius.com/13563852", "state": "pending", "votes": 11, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
