{"type": "song", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "They Know (Adin Ross Freestyle)", "status": "done", "targets": 0, "clicked": 0, "genius_url": "https://genius.com/Lil-uzi-vert-they-know-adin-ross-freestyle-lyrics", "genius_title": "They Know (Adin Ross Freestyle)", "genius_id": 7507357, "source": "api"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "They Don’t Love You (Sinking)", "line": "Pull up on a Griffin, my pockets like Peter", "vault_lines": ["Pull up on a Griffin, my pockets like Peter"], "meaning": "“Pull up on a Griffin, my pockets like Peter”\n\nThis line is a double entendre that splits “Peter Griffin” in half, using each name for a completely different meaning.\n“Pull up on a Griffin” uses the last name as a diss, calling someone soft, scared to actually do anything when it comes down to it.\n“My pockets like Peter” flips it into a flex right after. Peter Griffin is known for being overweight, so pockets “like Peter” means they’re fat too and loaded with cash.", "annotation_id": "40624315", "url": "https://genius.com/40624315", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "They Don’t Love You (Sinking)", "line": "Diamonds dancin’, yeah, they gleamin’ like they 3M", "vault_lines": ["Diamonds dancin', yeah, they gleamin' like they 3M"], "meaning": "“3M diamonds” usually refers to 3M’s industrial superabrasive products tools that use micron-sized industrial diamonds for aggressive grinding, sanding, and polishing of extremely hard materials like glass, stone, ceramics, and metal carbides.", "annotation_id": "40624289", "url": "https://genius.com/40624289", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "They Don’t Love You (Sinking)", "line": "Said she leaving, eye to eye yeah we ain’t seein’ (No, no)", "vault_lines": ["Said she leaving, eye to eye yeah wе ain't seein' (No, no)"], "meaning": "eye to eye we ain’t seein", "annotation_id": "32378659", "url": "https://genius.com/32378659", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
