{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "There She Go", "line": "Dirty dancin’, both hands in the air, there she go", "vault_lines": ["Dirty dancin', both hands in the air, there she go"], "meaning": "This is a reference to 1987 romantic drama movie Dirty Dancing and, in particular, to a famous scene in which the two main characters –played by Jennifer Grey (Baby) and Patrick Swayze (Johnny)– engage in a dance that, thanks to the climatic lift performed by the couple, immortalized the movie in the decades to follow.", "annotation_id": "22560815", "url": "https://genius.com/22560815", "state": "accepted", "votes": 15, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "There She Go", "line": "Rock and roll, you’re my rollin’ stone, baby", "vault_lines": ["Rock and roll, you're my rollin' stone, baby"], "meaning": "This is a reference to The Rolling Stones, a British rock band formed in 1962. They led the “British invasion” of rock and pop music alongside The Beatles. With 30 albums, 23 live albums, 25 compilation albums, and 120 singles under their belts, and having held 48 tours, The Rolling Stones have gone down as one of the biggest bands in history.\n\nJustin is also referring to this significant other, presumably his wife, Hailey, as his “rolling stone.” A rolling stone, derived from the phrase “A rolling stone gathers no moss,” is someone who doesn’t settle in one place for too long, and keeps life exciting and adventurous.", "annotation_id": "22560587", "url": "https://genius.com/22560587", "state": "pending", "votes": 6, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "song", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "There She Go", "status": "done", "targets": 2, "clicked": 0, "genius_url": "https://genius.com/Justin-bieber-there-she-go-lyrics", "genius_title": "There She Go", "genius_id": 6610409, "source": "api"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "The Way Life Goes", "line": "Wish I never ever, ever told you things I was only, only trying to show you things (Yeah)", "vault_lines": ["Wish I never ever, ever told you things"], "meaning": "Uzi regrets being vulnerable with his ex girlfriend as he had hoped that she wouldn’t leave after seeing that vulnerable side of him.", "annotation_id": "30367240", "url": "https://genius.com/30367240", "state": "pending", "votes": 6, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "The Way Life Goes", "line": "She don’t want me, I’m running wild (Running wild) You know I respect her on that level", "vault_lines": ["She don't want me, I'm running wild (Running wild)"], "meaning": "Uzi knows that he’s not the most committal man and is just having fun doing what he does, he then acknowledges that these might not be the most attractive habits of a boyfriend and respects her enough to be okay with her decision.", "annotation_id": "12928654", "url": "https://genius.com/12928654", "state": "accepted", "votes": 72, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "The Way Life Goes", "line": "Damn, that just goes to show me money don’t attract a thing (Real shit)", "vault_lines": ["Damn, that just goes to show me money don't attract a thing (Real shit)"], "meaning": "A common stereotype in hip-hop culture is that money leads to everything, leading people to praise the materialistic currency. Lil Uzi Vert comes to the conclusion that since his ex-girlfriend, Brittany, chose to be with a less successful man, not only does money not attract women, but can often attract negative attention.\n\nThis is contrary to many of Uzi’s lyrics from earlier in his career like on “7AM.” This is him realizing he might be wrong.\n\nGoyard on my waist, boy you ain’t got taste\nNow I’m getting cake, now your bitch gon' lay", "annotation_id": "12928617", "url": "https://genius.com/12928617", "state": "accepted", "votes": 61, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "The Way Life Goes", "line": "Iced out heart on your neck tried to froze your ring", "vault_lines": ["Iced out heart on your neck tried to froze your ring"], "meaning": "The former flame of Lil Uzi Vert, Brittany Byrd is wearing a pricy iced out chain with a heart pendant. This matches her icy heart.\n\nUzi is saying Byrd isn’t getting an engagement ring due to her cold heart.", "annotation_id": "12709631", "url": "https://genius.com/12709631", "state": "accepted", "votes": 46, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "The Way Life Goes", "line": "Stuck to the plan even though you used to go with my mans (Yeah)", "vault_lines": ["Stuck to the plan even though you used to go with my mans (Yeah)"], "meaning": "In a interview with Paper Magazine, Brittany Byrd, Uzi’s ex-girlfriend  explains how the two met.\n\nIt’s actually quite regular, we met through a mutual friend, and just had an instant connection.\n\nThe mutual friend described above was one of Uzi’s boys.", "annotation_id": "12606213", "url": "https://genius.com/12606213", "state": "accepted", "votes": 100, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "The Way Life Goes", "line": "My new chick I swear that she better, ooh Want me back, never, ooh (Ooh)", "vault_lines": ["My new chick I swear that she better, ooh"], "meaning": "Here, Uzi is referring to his ex-girlfriend Brittany Byrd and the possibility of them getting back together.\n\nBrittany Byrd used to date Uzi back when they were in high school; you could say that they were high school sweet hearts. They seemed to have a strong relationship until early 2014 where it started getting shaky. On June 25, 2016, Uzi announced that he was single ending his relationship with Brittany but still assuring that they’re more than friends.\n\nhttps://twitter.com/LILUZIVERT/status/746739042818101249\n\nhttps://twitter.com/LILUZIVERT/status/746046775811776512", "annotation_id": "12600776", "url": "https://genius.com/12600776", "state": "accepted", "votes": 60, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "The Way Life Goes", "line": "If she ever call my phone you know I gotta dead her But I like that girl too much, I wish I never met her (Hello)", "vault_lines": ["Wish I never ever, ever told you things"], "meaning": "Now that Brittany and Uzi have broken up, Uzi wants to cut contact with Brittany because he needs time to heal. To “dead” someone is to cut all ties with a person.\n\nhttps://twitter.com/LILUZIVERT/status/746739042818101249?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw&ref_url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.themaven.net%2Fallhiphop%2Fnews%2Flil-uzi-announces-official-breakup-with-girlfriend-brittany-byrd-FVf1XPO5mkaL-ymJEE_Fdw-FVf1XPO5mkaL-ymJEE_Fdw", "annotation_id": "12588978", "url": "https://genius.com/12588978", "state": "accepted", "votes": 304, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "The Way Life Goes", "line": "I had to get me a new bitch to hold the pain We was in Hawaii looking at the ring (Damn), yeah She smiling happy, but I’m laughing ’cause her new man’s a lame", "vault_lines": ["I had to get me a new bitch to hold the pain"], "meaning": "This refers to when Uzi escaped to the islands of Hawaii for a short getaway as covered by Fader. Interestingly, this is where the “Do What I Want” music video was shot.\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zqflC-as2Qo\n\nIn this line, Uzi is reminiscing over his vacation when he was enjoying his time with his girl. However, he created a new relationship since the memories that came with breaking up with her were too overwhelming until he realized that she left him for a “poser.”", "annotation_id": "12588863", "url": "https://genius.com/12588863", "state": "accepted", "votes": 123, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "The Way Life Goes", "line": "I was listening to this song It go like", "vault_lines": ["I was listening to this song"], "meaning": "Referring to the interpolation of Oh Wonder’s “Landslide” on the chorus.", "annotation_id": "12585959", "url": "https://genius.com/12585959", "state": "accepted", "votes": 194, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "The Way Life Goes", "line": "(Broke boy, broke boy, broke boy, broke boy)", "vault_lines": ["That's true (That's true), that's right (That right, that right)"], "meaning": "Vert references the song “Broke Boi” by fellow collaborator Playboi Carti. He’s also referring the the previous line about Brittany’s new man, calling him a “broke boi.”", "annotation_id": "12585556", "url": "https://genius.com/12585556", "state": "accepted", "votes": 139, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "The Way Life Goes", "line": "Just talked to your homie, she said we should be together (Yeah) Gave me brain, was so insane that I made her my header (Woah)", "vault_lines": ["Just talked to your homie, she said we should be together (Yeah)"], "meaning": "Uzi enjoyed the oral sex from his ex-girlfriend Brittany so much that he decided to lock her down by updating his header photo on Twitter to a picture of her.\n\nThe word “header” plays off “head,” another euphemism for oral sex.", "annotation_id": "12585521", "url": "https://genius.com/12585521", "state": "accepted", "votes": 216, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "The Way Life Goes", "line": "Walk off my Saint Laurent, that leather, ooh (Yeah)", "vault_lines": ["Walk off my Saint Laurent, that leather, ooh (Yeah)"], "meaning": "Lil Uzi is talking about clothing from Yves Saint Laurent, possibly the same boots he mentions in “Canadian Goose.” \nDriving around in a what, Saint Laurent all on my boots, Saint Laurent all on my boo― Lil Uzi Vert – Canadian Goose", "annotation_id": "12583980", "url": "https://genius.com/12583980", "state": "accepted", "votes": 43, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "The Way Life Goes", "line": "Diamonds on your neck, ice all on my wrist Complement my style (Style)", "vault_lines": ["Diamonds on your neck, ice all on my wrist"], "meaning": "Both Uzi and his ex Brittany Byrd were known for wearing “ice”, aka diamonds.", "annotation_id": "12582901", "url": "https://genius.com/12582901", "state": "accepted", "votes": 51, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "The Way Life Goes", "line": "See, I tied up my Raf, you strapped up your Rick", "vault_lines": ["See, I tied up my Raf, you strapped up your Rick"], "meaning": "Uzi is singing to his ex-girl, probably Brittany. He laces up his Raf Simons shoes while she is strapping on her Rick Owens shoes.\n\nThis line could also be a reference to “Nuyork Nights at 21” off of Luv is Rage where he sings the lyrics:\n\nI was rocking Rick Owens, you was rocking Raf\n\nBrittany was a fashion student, frequently sporting brands like Raf Simons and Rick Owens.\n\n\n\nBrittany via Instagram: “A lil Rick a lil Raf.”\n\nThe line could also represent the end of the relationship, since tying your shoes is the final step in putting them on. This could also imply that they are putting on their shoes because they are ready to go their separate ways.", "annotation_id": "12582682", "url": "https://genius.com/12582682", "state": "accepted", "votes": 99, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "The Way Life Goes", "line": "My Louboutins new, so my bottoms, they is redder (Yeah, it’s red)", "vault_lines": ["My Louboutins new, so my bottoms, they is redder (Yeah, it's red)"], "meaning": "Christian Louboutin is a high-end French fashion house. Louboutin are most famous for their footwear, distinguishable by the trademark red sole. With continuous use, the redness fades over time.\n\nLil Uzi Vert’s Louboutin shoes are new, meaning that the sole of his shoes are at their reddest.", "annotation_id": "12581570", "url": "https://genius.com/12581570", "state": "accepted", "votes": 107, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "The Way Life Goes", "line": "That’s true (That’s true), that’s right (That right, that right) She’s sipping Moët, and yeah, I swear it get her wetter", "vault_lines": ["That's true (That's true), that's right (That right, that right)"], "meaning": "Moët & Chandon is a prominent champagne brand.\n\n\n\nLil Uzi Vert enunciates ‘Moet\" as moh-wet to play off the second line.", "annotation_id": "12581563", "url": "https://genius.com/12581563", "state": "accepted", "votes": 165, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "The Way Life Goes", "line": "No, I’m not a rat, but I’m all about my cheddar (’Bout my bread)", "vault_lines": ["No, I'm not a rat, but I'm all about my cheddar ('Bout my bread)"], "meaning": "Not to be confused with the criminal or street meaning of someone who snitches to the police; Uzi simply loves to get money the same way an actual “rat” or rodent loves to get cheese.", "annotation_id": "12580362", "url": "https://genius.com/12580362", "state": "accepted", "votes": 184, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "The Way Life Goes", "line": "I know it hurts sometimes, but you’ll get over it (Yeah) You’ll find another life to live (Yeah) I swear that you’ll get over it I know you’re sad and tired You’ve got nothing left to give (Yeah) You’ll find another life to live (Yeah) I know that you’ll get over it (Yeah)", "vault_lines": ["I know it hurts sometimes, but you'll get over it (Yeah)"], "meaning": "Uzi interpolates and samples the first verse of the July 2015 single “Landslide” by Oh Wonder, layering his new vocals and ad-libs over a sample of the original song. Josephine Vander Gucht and Anthony West’s lyrics from the original detail their own personal struggle with heartbreak:\n\nI know it hurts sometimes but\nYou’ll get over it\nYou’ll find another life to live\nI know you’ll get over it\nI know you’re sad and tired\nYou’ve got nothing left to give\nBut you’ll find another life to live\nI know you’ll get over it\n\nIn a tweet from July 2015, the group duo detailed the themes behind the track:\n\nIt’s for all the broken hearts, lost souls and missed opportunities", "annotation_id": "12580123", "url": "https://genius.com/12580123", "state": "accepted", "votes": 486, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
