{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "The Walk (Naw)", "line": "She a shark, in the water, call her, “Jaw”", "vault_lines": ["She a shark, in the water, call her, \"Jaw\" (Yeah, it's Lil Uzi Vert)"], "meaning": "This is a reference to the film Jaws, which the poster/cover for it shows a shark coming out of the water with its jaws open for someone.\n\nUzi is saying the bitch is ready to eat him after he makes her wet.", "annotation_id": "38638283", "url": "https://genius.com/38638283", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
