{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "The Rush", "line": "Gustavo in my blunt (Yeah)", "vault_lines": ["Gustavo in my blunt (Wow)"], "meaning": "n the show Big Time Rush, Gustavo is the band’s manager. Gustavo is known to be on the heavier side here Uzi is saying that his blunts are so fat he stuffed Gustavo in them.", "annotation_id": "33525509", "url": "https://genius.com/33525509", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
