{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "The Rush", "line": "Got a Richie on my wrist, yeah", "vault_lines": ["Got a Richie on my wrist, yeah"], "meaning": "Uzi refers to the luxury Swiss watch brand, Richard Mille, renowned for its high-tech, avant-garde designs and exclusivity.\n\nUzi has been seen wearing several models from the brand, including the Richard Mille RM020 at the Roc Nation Brunch and the RM011 at the Grammys.\n\n\nUzi wearing his Richard Mille RM020 at the Roc Nation Brunch.", "annotation_id": "33473317", "url": "https://genius.com/33473317", "state": "pending", "votes": 6, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "The Rush", "line": "I still wear that Rick, yeah", "vault_lines": ["I still wear that Rick, yeah"], "meaning": "Lil Uzi Vert frequently showcases his love for Rick Owens, an American designer celebrated for merging dark, industrial aesthetics with luxury.\n\nRick Owens pieces are a staple in both Uzi’s wardrobe and lyrics, including his track “Enemies,” where he raps: “I’m rocking Rick Owens, your bitch on my dick and that bitch she be hoeing\n\n\n\nUzi wearing Rick Owens’ Gethsemane Geth Pearl Bomber Jacket, paired with Moncler × Rick Owens Logo Cashmere Beanie Hat, Grey Subhuman Cut-Out Jumper, and Green Knitted Shorts.", "annotation_id": "33473178", "url": "https://genius.com/33473178", "state": "pending", "votes": 9, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "The Rush", "line": "Bitch, I’m a king like I’m Tip, yeah", "vault_lines": ["Bitch, I'm a king like I'm Tip, yeah"], "meaning": "Uzi nods to Atlanta rapper T.I., also known as “Tip.” T.I. dubbed himself the King of the South, and his album King (2006) cemented this claim and helped make him one of the era’s most influential rappers in Atlanta’s hip-hop scene.", "annotation_id": "33472973", "url": "https://genius.com/33472973", "state": "pending", "votes": 9, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "The Rush", "line": "I feel like Ben 10, yeah Ben 10, 10, Tennyson, yeah", "vault_lines": ["I feel like Ben 10, yeah"], "meaning": "“Ben Ten” is an animated series on Cartoon Network about a boy named Ben Tennyson who discovers the Omnitrix, a watch that transforms him into various aliens. With the help of his cousin Gwen and grandfather Max, Ben uses his alien powers to fight evil intergalactic villains.\n\nhttps://filepicker-images.genius.com/21f255c1d59c20ee5388f7fe3a17ec993dd4b026081599634f9e7c02e1321357%2Fkm58i5fayrk", "annotation_id": "33466928", "url": "https://genius.com/33466928", "state": "pending", "votes": 17, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "The Rush", "line": "Just like brûlée, make her crème, yeah", "vault_lines": ["Just like brûlée, make her crème, yeah"], "meaning": "Crème brûlée is a dessert consisting of a rich custard base topped with a layer of hardened caramelized sugar.", "annotation_id": "33466797", "url": "https://genius.com/33466797", "state": "pending", "votes": 13, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "song", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "The Rush", "status": "done", "targets": 13, "clicked": 0, "genius_url": "https://genius.com/Lil-uzi-vert-the-rush-lyrics", "genius_title": "The Rush", "genius_id": 11040512, "source": "api"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "The Man", "line": "Codeine got me feeling like I’m Fat Joe so I lean back", "vault_lines": ["Codeine got me feeling like I’m Fat Joe so I lean back"], "meaning": "Codeine is an opiate, mainly used to treat pain, coughing and diarrhoea.\n\nIn this line, Lil Uzi notes its possible side effects of drowsiness, referring to Fat Joe’s hit song, “Lean Back”. Uzi may also suggest this specifically through the slang term, ‘lean’, a recreational drink that contains the codeine, and is commonly used interchangeably with it.\n\n\n\nThe recreational drink, 'lean'\n\n\nUzi further hints at the physical impacts that the drug can have, implied through his reference to Fat Joe, which may allude to his weight and large physical appearance, similar to that of Gucci Mane, at the time of the song’s release, who notably abused the opiate, giving him what fans referred to as a ‘lean belly’.\n\n\n\nGucci Mane", "annotation_id": "26293396", "url": "https://genius.com/26293396", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
