{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "The Advantage", "line": "Molly, the acid, the mushroom just settled in", "vault_lines": ["Molly, the acid, the mushroom just settled in"], "meaning": "Uzi combines three drugs that are known for being highly synergistic, each potentiating the effects of the others: MDMA, a stimulant and empathogenic, as well as the classic psychadelics LSD, and Psilocybin mushrooms. The combination of MDMA and LSD is quite common, and reffered to as “Candyflip” in the drug scene.", "annotation_id": "37814459", "url": "https://genius.com/37814459", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "The Advantage", "line": "Move like a veteran in my new VETEMENTS", "vault_lines": ["Move like a veteran in my new VETEMENTS"], "meaning": "VETEMENTS is a Swiss luxury fashion house that are well-known for their oversized clothing. Their clothes are perfect for consealing items that would not be well hidden under normal circumstances.\n\nUnder his VETEMENTS, Uzi is able to discreetly carry larger weapons or in his words, “move like a veteran”.", "annotation_id": "27074447", "url": "https://genius.com/27074447", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "The Advantage", "line": "No, you not my baby, I had to abort (Woah, yeah)", "vault_lines": ["No, you not my baby, I had to abort (Woah, yeah)"], "meaning": "the girl he is talking about is his “baby” and when you dont want a baby you abort it", "annotation_id": "26930930", "url": "https://genius.com/26930930", "state": "pending", "votes": -1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "The Advantage", "line": "I’m ballin’ like A.I., I’m askin’ a question, but no, no, no, I do not know-know the answer (Answer)", "vault_lines": ["I had to tell Rock to close the door (Door)"], "meaning": "Famous basketball star allen Iversons nickname was the answer, and uzi is referencing him knowing the answer to allens nickname", "annotation_id": "26930910", "url": "https://genius.com/26930910", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
