{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "That’s on You", "line": "Call up Donald Trump and tell him, ”My bitch, yeah She comin’ just straight from the border”", "vault_lines": ["Call up Donald Trump and tell him, \"My bitch, yeah"], "meaning": "Donald Trump is the 45th president of the United States. Trump was known for being very strict against illegal immigration which a significant number of illegal immigrants to the US come through its southern border which is shared with Mexico. In this line Uzi is saying his girl is foreign so he will report her to Trump for coming illegally to the US across the border, thus getting her deported.", "annotation_id": "25909488", "url": "https://genius.com/25909488", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "That’s on You", "line": "Bitches come and go but my money stay (stay)", "vault_lines": ["Bitches come and go but my money stay (stay)"], "meaning": "This is a clever reference to the song “Ginseng Strip 2002” by hip-hop pioneer, Jonatan Leandoer, also known as Yung Lean. These lyrics pay respect to the opening lines, “Bitches come and go, brah, but you know I stay”.", "annotation_id": "19811808", "url": "https://genius.com/19811808", "state": "pending", "votes": 6, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "song", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "That’s on You", "status": "done", "targets": 2, "clicked": 0, "genius_url": "https://genius.com/Rambo-savage-thats-on-you-lyrics", "genius_title": "That’s on You", "genius_id": 3724377, "source": "api"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "That’s a Rack", "line": "I got on Dior, and my skinnies, they all black", "vault_lines": ["I got on Dior, and my skinnies, they all black"], "meaning": "“I got on Dior, and my skinnies, they all black.”\n\nmeans Lil Uzi Vert is describing his designer outfit and fashion style.\n\nHere’s the breakdown:\n\n\n“I got on Dior” – He’s wearing clothing or accessories from Dior, a luxury fashion brand. Mentioning Dior is a way of showing wealth, status, and an expensive sense of style.\n“My skinnies, they all black” – “Skinnies” refers to skinny jeans or skinny pants. Saying they’re “all black” means he’s wearing black skinny jeans, which have long been a signature look in hip-hop and streetwear.", "annotation_id": "40912197", "url": "https://genius.com/40912197", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "That’s a Rack", "line": "Bentley, Hellcat, new Lambo and Maybach", "vault_lines": ["Bentley, Hellcat, new Lambo and Maybach"], "meaning": "“Bentley, Hellcat, new Lambo and Maybach”\n\nis essentially him listing a collection of expensive, high-status cars to emphasize his wealth and success.\n\nHere’s the breakdown:\n\n\nBentley – A British luxury car brand associated with wealth and elegance.\nHellcat – A high-performance version of the Dodge Challenger or Charger, known for its supercharged V8 engine and extreme horsepower.\nNew Lambo – Short for a new Lamborghini, one of the world’s most recognizable exotic supercars.\nMaybach – A luxury line of Mercedes-Benz vehicles, often associated with celebrities, executives, and ultra-high-end comfort.", "annotation_id": "40912165", "url": "https://genius.com/40912165", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "That’s a Rack", "line": "Overseas, I’m eatin’ croissants Told a fuck nigga, “Don’t touch my crumpet” (No)", "vault_lines": ["Overseas, I'm eatin' croissants"], "meaning": "Uzi references his luxurious, international lifestyle, including being overseas and eating European foods like croissants and crumpets (commonly associated with France and Britain). The line contrasts his wealthy lifestyle with a playful warning not to interfere with what is his.", "annotation_id": "40748798", "url": "https://genius.com/40748798", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
