{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "That Fiya", "line": ".44 on my body, bitch, this shit, it hit like (.44 on my body)", "vault_lines": [".44 on my body, bitch, this shit, it hit like (.44 on my body)"], "meaning": "44 caliber is a family of large-caliber firearm cartridges and firearms, particularly revolvers. And by staying that Little Uzi Vertical has one by him he is just sayin that he is not one to mess with, and he is a danger for the so called opposition.", "annotation_id": "28935309", "url": "https://genius.com/28935309", "state": "pending", "votes": 13, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
