{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Take Off (Remix)", "line": "They be like, “Popp, you so motherfuckin’ hot” If you stand too close then you might catch a tan", "vault_lines": ["They be like, \"Popp, you so motherfuckin' hot\""], "meaning": "Hot in these terms, means popular. Popp Hunna is saying he’s so popular that you could literally catch a tan.", "annotation_id": "28143043", "url": "https://genius.com/28143043", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
