{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Take A Trip (Kayak)", "line": "This Picasso up in my crib, of course (Let’s go)", "vault_lines": ["This Picasso up in my crib, of course (Let's go)"], "meaning": "Uzi suggests that he has a painting by the renowned artist Pablo Picasso displayed in his home.\n\nPablo Picasso was a highly influential artist known for his pioneering role in the development of Cubism, as well as his contributions to Surrealism and other artistic movements of the 20th century. His artworks are considered highly valuable and prestigious, often fetching millions of dollars at auctions.", "annotation_id": "31348165", "url": "https://genius.com/31348165", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
