{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "THUGGER VOICE", "line": "I’m fucking with Reese Mane, (LaFlare!) I think this shit funny", "vault_lines": ["I'm fucking with Reese Mane, (LaFlare!)"], "meaning": "Reese, also known as Reese Mane La Flare is a rapper from Zone 6, Atlanta, who Lil Uzi still used to be affiliated with during the period this song was recorded.\n\n Around the same time, they were set to release a project named Home Economic$ together, but for some reason it was never released.\n\n\n\nSince then, they have dissed each other, accused one another of biting, and even tried to fight at one point.\nhttps://twitter.com/LILUZIVERT/status/726189713665757185", "annotation_id": "11120730", "url": "https://genius.com/11120730", "state": "accepted", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
