{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "T Time", "line": "Compact two-tone Glock, tweakin’ the mechanism with the notch", "vault_lines": ["Compact two-tone Glock, tweakin' the mechanism with the notch"], "meaning": "referencing an compact 17 round pistol, that has been messed with, modifying internal slide to prevent adding a switch to it\n\ntwo tone just references it has two colors", "annotation_id": "38774965", "url": "https://genius.com/38774965", "state": "pending", "votes": -2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "T Time", "line": "Angelina Jolie once said I can’t miss the shot", "vault_lines": ["Angelina Jolie once said I can't miss the shot"], "meaning": "This lyric is a double entendre. On the surface, it references Angelina Jolie’s role as Fox in the 2008 movie Wanted. In the film, Fox is known for her line “I can’t miss” and for her signature ability to curve bullets — always hitting her target.\n\nUzi flips this into a comparison with himself: just as Fox never misses a shot, he’s saying he also can’t miss — whether it’s in life, music, or even a violent context. It’s both a nod to the movie and a boast about his own accuracy and dominance.", "annotation_id": "37243777", "url": "https://genius.com/37243777", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "T Time", "line": "They thought I was cool with the devil, but Satan gave me a stick, can’t get his shit back", "vault_lines": ["They thought I was cool with the devil, but Satan gave me a stick, can't get his shit back"], "meaning": "Lil Uzi Vert has been associated with Satan by critics and haters when he has proven many times before he does not associate with Satanism or anything relating to the devil.\n\nSummer Walker called out Lil Uzi once for a lyric referencing Satan and JT, one of the City Girls.", "annotation_id": "37126444", "url": "https://genius.com/37126444", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
