{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Swap", "line": "Outer space coupe like the Jetsons", "vault_lines": ["Outer space coupe like the Jetsons"], "meaning": "The Jetsons is an animated sitcom that lasted 3 seasons over revival. Originally aired for a single season on ABC, the show is based on a family living in a futuristic world, specifically a fictional place named Orbit City. The movie Jetsons: The Movie served as a series finale to the show.", "annotation_id": "21688127", "url": "https://genius.com/21688127", "state": "accepted", "votes": 5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
