{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Swag Swag", "line": "Told that boy, “This a satchel, not a girl bag” (No way) This that, “I get guap, I’ve been around the world” bag", "vault_lines": ["Told that boy, \"This a satchel, not a girl bag\" (No way)"], "meaning": "Uzi responds to critics of his fashion choices by clarifying that the “girl bag” he carries is in fact a satchel.", "annotation_id": "39181120", "url": "https://genius.com/39181120", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
