{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Swag Swag", "line": "I got swag, swag (Yeah, ayy) Walk in, ten bands, my Chanel bag (Double C, double C) Told that boy, “This a satchel, not a girl bag” (No way) This that, “I get guap, I’ve been around the world” bag Why you so mad? (Hello?) I got swag (What?), swag Walk in, 10K, my Chanel bag (Double C, double C) Told that boy, “This a satchel, not a girl bag” (10K on me) This that, “I get guap, I’ve been around the world” bag", "vault_lines": ["I got swag, swag (Yeah, ayy)"], "meaning": "best artist alive", "annotation_id": "34439994", "url": "https://genius.com/34439994", "state": "pending", "votes": 11, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Swag Swag", "line": "Tolerate no disrespect, my niggas toe your tag, yeah (Huh?) Mean, um, tag your toe (Oh, yeah), I might fuck your ho (Ayy)", "vault_lines": ["I got swag, swag (Yeah, ayy)"], "meaning": "Putting a tag on ones toe is standard practice for identifying dead bodies arriving at a morgue. The tag is attached to the big toe and contains information about the person like name, age, sex, height, weight, place and cause of death etc…\n\nUzi is letting it be known if you disrespect him or his friends you will end up dead and he might even carry out the hit himself.", "annotation_id": "34382973", "url": "https://genius.com/34382973", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
