{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Suicide Doors", "line": "Suicide whores tryna fuck me for", "vault_lines": ["Suicide whores tryna fuck me for"], "meaning": "Uzi is referencing to the sex workers from the South Carolina gang Suicide Squad (SS) that he is closely related to.\n\nHe has had SS in his instagram bio multiple times and even has tattoos of SS on his face and hand.\n\n\n\n\n\nHe and his artist friend NGeeYL have a song “Off-White”, where almost every other adlib is “SSet” shout outing their gang.\n\nAlthough Uzi is known not to be associated with any gangs, SS is as close as it gets.", "annotation_id": "28961620", "url": "https://genius.com/28961620", "state": "pending", "votes": 10, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Suicide Doors", "line": "I just wanna crash out in a Trackhawk", "vault_lines": ["I just wanna crash out in a Trackhawk"], "meaning": "In this lyric, Uzi is referring to the Jeep Grand Cherokee Trackhawk, a high-powered SUV that can reach prices as high as $100K.", "annotation_id": "28948531", "url": "https://genius.com/28948531", "state": "pending", "votes": 17, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
