{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Street Music", "line": "I’m O.T. with the CoCo", "vault_lines": ["I'm O.T. with the CoCo"], "meaning": "Uzi references O.T Genasis' 2014 hit, “CoCo”, in which O.T repeats the lines “I’m in love with the CoCo” throughout the song.\n\nUzi compares themselves to O.T because they presumably are also in love with the CoCo.", "annotation_id": "28969643", "url": "https://genius.com/28969643", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
