{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Stay Awake", "line": "Yeah, I’m so out of love, it’s not for me", "vault_lines": ["Yeah, I'm so out of love, it's not for me"], "meaning": "uzi mean that he is tired of realtionships so he say that he dont got love for anyone and that he dont want a realationship", "annotation_id": "31968082", "url": "https://genius.com/31968082", "state": "pending", "votes": -1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Stay Awake", "line": "Like, do they look at me like bait the way these niggas be biting, yeah? (Yeah)", "vault_lines": ["Like, do they look at me like bait the way these niggas be biting, yeah? (Yeah)"], "meaning": "In these lyrics from SoFaygo, he’s expressing frustration and questioning how others perceive him. The phrase “do they look at me like bait” suggests that he feels like others see him as someone to be used or exploited, much like bait is used to catch fish. The line “the way these niggas be biting” refers to others copying or imitating his style or actions, implying a sense of being preyed upon or taken advantage of by those who mimic him without originality. This lyric conveys a theme of distrust and the struggles of dealing with people who aren’t genuine.", "annotation_id": "31804019", "url": "https://genius.com/31804019", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
