{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Stay Awake", "line": "Went out sad one time, can’t go out bad (No)", "vault_lines": ["Went out sad one time, can't go out bad (No)"], "meaning": "This is in reference to Uzi’s 2020 track, “That Way”, a sample/remix of “I Want It That Way” by The Backstreet Boys.\n\nThe pre-chorus of the track has Uzi rapping about his time and longevity in the rap game, saying:\n\nBut I don’t wanna go out bad, wanna go out sad, wanna go out that way", "annotation_id": "27101679", "url": "https://genius.com/27101679", "state": "accepted", "votes": 11, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
