{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Space High", "line": "You try to say I don’t got swag, but I look at your shirt, it look like you still in Burberry much (Woah)", "vault_lines": ["Hi, how are you doing? I'm Lil Uzi (Brr)"], "meaning": "Uzi mentions that people criticize their fashion, and explains how he doesn’t understand why someone could hate on his fashion if they are “still in Burberry much.”\n\nUzi is referring to the luxury fashion group “Burberry,” which he believes is old fashion, despite having songs mentioning Burberry clothing– such as “Stripes Like Burberry”", "annotation_id": "35748481", "url": "https://genius.com/35748481", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Space High", "line": "They think I’m the devil, please don’t put your heart in it I do know Jesus, that nigga the carpenter?", "vault_lines": ["They think I'm the devil, please don't put your heart in it"], "meaning": "Uzi is saying “You think I’m the devil, but i know Jesus”, but you can also read Jesus as (hay-SOOS) which is a common hispanic name, and hispanic people are usually good at things like building homes. So uzi does not know Jesus but he knows Jesus, the one hispanic homie who put carpet in his mansion.", "annotation_id": "34364247", "url": "https://genius.com/34364247", "state": "pending", "votes": -20, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Space High", "line": "Got a Canadian, she gave me mental top", "vault_lines": ["Got a Canadian, she gave me mental top"], "meaning": "Uzi uses a double entendre and says he doesn’t wear Arc'teryx, and would rather wear another apparel company’s coat collection Canadian Goose. He could also be saying that he has Canadian girls giving him oral sex.", "annotation_id": "34141857", "url": "https://genius.com/34141857", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Space High", "line": "Stop wearin’ that Arc’teryx, I live on a mountaintop", "vault_lines": ["Stop wearin' that Arc'teryx, I live on a mountaintop"], "meaning": "Arc'teryx is a Canadian apparel company specializing in outdoor apparel and equipment headquartered in North Vancouver, British Columbia. It focuses on technical apparel for mountaineering and Alpine sports, including related accessories.\n\nIt is frequently worn in low-temperature climates like mountaintops.", "annotation_id": "34141855", "url": "https://genius.com/34141855", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Space High", "line": "Stop wearin’ that Arc’teryx, I live on a mountaintop", "vault_lines": ["Stop wearin' that Arc'teryx, I live on a mountaintop"], "meaning": "Arc'teryx is a Canadian apparel company specializing in outdoor apparel and equipment headquartered in North Vancouver, British Columbia. It focuses on technical apparel for mountaineering and Alpine sports, including related accessories.\n\nIt is frequently worn in low-temperature climates like mountaintops.", "annotation_id": "34102048", "url": "https://genius.com/34102048", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
