{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Space High", "line": "Every time I take the ’shrooms, I gotta take a shit (Huh?)", "vault_lines": ["Every time I take the 'shrooms, I gotta take a shit (Huh?)"], "meaning": "Shrooms can often cause an upset stomach during the comeup especially if you ate before you took the shroomies. If U Know u know Fr but this line Real Asf", "annotation_id": "33525300", "url": "https://genius.com/33525300", "state": "pending", "votes": 8, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Space High", "line": "Jatavia", "vault_lines": [", eight, nine, ten, eleven, twelve, thirteen million right to Jatavia"], "meaning": "JT’s full name is: Jatavia Shakara Johnson.\nJT and Lil Uzi Vert have been dating since 2019, but came out to the public in 2023.\n\n\nUzi on the left, JT on the right", "annotation_id": "33505289", "url": "https://genius.com/33505289", "state": "accepted", "votes": 5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
