{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Sossboy 2", "line": "Money talk at the same time like “Jinx” I can’t smoke if that shit don’t stink I’m on the web, she wanna link", "vault_lines": ["Money talk at the same time like \"Jinx\""], "meaning": "These lines are a reference to the chorus of the song “Love Reeks” also known at the time as “Mr. Deeds” or “Deeds”, where he says:\n\nAnd they say love don’t stink\nLosin' my mind, girl, I don’t wanna think\nThirst in your love, girl, I don’t wanna drink\nGotta get bands like NSYNC or Backstreet\nDiamonds is dancin' like ice skating rinks\nThey scream my name at the same time like jinx\nI got that pendant, so she wanna link\nLove her like 14, but it was too weak\n“Love Reeks” Chorus\nHighlighted parts are rhymes that have similarities\n\nThe song dates back to 2018 and was one of the most anticipated grails among fans, eventually being released on the Grails EP in 2023.", "annotation_id": "41150517", "url": "https://genius.com/41150517", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Sossboy 2", "line": "You like a midget, keep comin’ up short", "vault_lines": ["You like a midget, keep comin' up short"], "meaning": "crazy he says this on a song with uzi lmfao", "annotation_id": "27711198", "url": "https://genius.com/27711198", "state": "pending", "votes": 8, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Sossboy 2", "line": "You stabbed me in the back like Zelda and Link", "vault_lines": ["You stabbed me in the back like Zelda and Link"], "meaning": "This is a reference to The Legend Of Zelda series, a fantasy action adventure video game franchise created by Nintendo.\n\n\n\n“Zelda and Link” both rhyme together, as Zelda and Link are both characters of the series, with Link being the main protagonist. As for “stabbing”, Zelda games feature combat mostly done by using sword combat, which makes the line “You stabbed me” make more sense. It also acts as a metaphor for heartbreak since Zelda is usually captured and you must save her in most Zelda games.", "annotation_id": "23403619", "url": "https://genius.com/23403619", "state": "pending", "votes": 6, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Sossboy 2", "line": "I got bands like I’m *NSYNC", "vault_lines": ["I got bands like I'm *NSYNC"], "meaning": "This is play on words wherein, Pierre strictly implies that he has bands (meaning he has loads of money, typically “thousands” in one “band”) like *NSYNC, which was a famous boy band back in the late 90s and early 2000s.", "annotation_id": "23261145", "url": "https://genius.com/23261145", "state": "pending", "votes": 7, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Sossboy 2", "line": "You niggas funny like Richard Pryor", "vault_lines": ["You niggas funny like Richard Pryor"], "meaning": "Pi'erre is amused by those who claim to be on his level. He compares his laughable competitors to revered African-American comedian Richard Pryor, who is widely considered to be one of the most influential stand-up comedians of all time.\n\nPryor has had many successful shows, such as That Nigger’s Crazy and Bicentennial Nigger, both of which earned Pryor Grammy awards for Best Comedy Album.", "annotation_id": "23261089", "url": "https://genius.com/23261089", "state": "accepted", "votes": 8, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Sossboy 2", "line": "When I’m in Paris, it’s J’adore", "vault_lines": ["When I'm in Paris, it's J'adore"], "meaning": "J’adore is a name of a perfume line for Christian Dior, better known as simply “Dior”.\n\n\n\nJ’adore also translates to “I really love” or “I love” which coincides with the name of the company, Dior (I love Dior)", "annotation_id": "23261028", "url": "https://genius.com/23261028", "state": "pending", "votes": 7, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Sossboy 2", "line": "Dick so big that I fucked your bitch and I made her bleed like her name Carrie (Ayy, ayy, ayy, ayy)", "vault_lines": ["Dick so big that I fucked your bitch and I made her bleed like her name Carrie (Ayy, ayy, ayy, ayy)"], "meaning": "Carrie: Blood of Redemption is a supernatural drama thriller movie. It is notable for a scene where the character is soaked in blood.\nhttps://www.bing.com/videos/search?q=carrie+blood&docid=608044498799571499&mid=87244CB724C7E371310F87244CB724C7E371310F&view=detail&FORM=VIRE", "annotation_id": "23247899", "url": "https://genius.com/23247899", "state": "pending", "votes": 6, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Sossboy 2", "line": "Car so fast, look like Andretti (Ayy, skrrt)", "vault_lines": ["Car so fast, look like Andretti (Ayy, skrrt)"], "meaning": "Mario Andretti is an Italian-born American former racing driver and is one of the most successful in the world. He is the only person to have been named United States Driver of the Year in three decades and one of three to have won races in NASCAR, Formula One, IndyCar and the World Sportscar Championship. Uzi is saying his car is fast.", "annotation_id": "23241062", "url": "https://genius.com/23241062", "state": "pending", "votes": 14, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Sossboy 2", "line": "Diamonds on my neck, it got my fuckin’ throat froze", "vault_lines": ["Diamonds on my neck, it got my fuckin' throat froze"], "meaning": "Diamonds are also referred to as “ice,” which freezes his neck and throat. This is also a callback to the line before. Uzi’s throat is freezing up due to the ice on his neck and the amount of head he is giving. Might be also a referrence to his track “Diamonds all on my wrist”, where he frequently repeat some verses about his diamonds.", "annotation_id": "23239200", "url": "https://genius.com/23239200", "state": "pending", "votes": 5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Sossboy 2", "line": "Why? Why? Want to work hard for them Work hard for them", "vault_lines": ["Want to work hard for them"], "meaning": "This intro is spoken by Pi’erre’s uncle, who Pi’erre has frequently cited as a major inspiration for his music. Just a few weeks before the release of the song, Pi’erre announced that his uncle had passed away.\n\nhttps://twitter.com/pierrebourne/status/1394393867340898304?s=21", "annotation_id": "23235502", "url": "https://genius.com/23235502", "state": "accepted", "votes": 52, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Sossboy 2", "line": "She got that WAP, close my eye, Fetty (Ayy, ayy)", "vault_lines": ["She got that WAP, close my eye, Fetty (Ayy, ayy)"], "meaning": "Uzi is referring to the song titled, “WAP” by Cardi B, which debuted at #1 on the Billboard Hot 100 during the charting week of August 22, 2020. The word “WAP” and the meaning are both repeated throughout the chorus of Cardi B’s song.\n\nLil Uzi Vert is also referring to New Jersey rapper, Fetty Wap, who lost one of his eyes to congenital glaucoma when he was young.\n\nFetty elaborated on what happened to his eye back in 2015 in an interview where he said:\n\n“When I was little I had gotten into a little accident and it gave me congenital glaucoma in both of my eyes.”", "annotation_id": "23214393", "url": "https://genius.com/23214393", "state": "accepted", "votes": 24, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
