{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Soarin’ (Catfish)*", "line": "I’ll be there in five, like the Jacksons", "vault_lines": ["I'll be there in five, like the Jacksons"], "meaning": "This line’s a nod to the Jackson 5 song “I’ll Be There”, not an actual time. It’s a playful way of saying “I’m on my way,” while also referencing the song’s message of loyalty and support, plus that classic Michael Jackson vibe.", "annotation_id": "36361375", "url": "https://genius.com/36361375", "state": "pending", "votes": -1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
