{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "So Hit", "line": "Most of these niggas, they hate (They hate) I do not walk in no J’s (No)", "vault_lines": ["Most of these niggas, they hate (They hate)"], "meaning": "Jordans are too basic for Lil Uzi who has an interview with complex about sneakers\n\nhttps://youtu.be/RAy3h9UrCiI", "annotation_id": "11187943", "url": "https://genius.com/11187943", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "So Hit", "line": "Look at my Rollie, I don’t got the time, uh (Blaow, damn)", "vault_lines": ["Look at my Rollie, I don't got the time, uh (Blaow, damn)"], "meaning": "Uzi’s “Rollie” or Rolex, is flooded out with gold and diamonds, so it is hard for him to ac​tually see what time it is because of how bright it shines.", "annotation_id": "8871508", "url": "https://genius.com/8871508", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "So Hit", "line": "Damn, I got rich quick, yeah Got a rich bitch, like, “You so hit” Ayy, “You so hit” Damn, I got rich quick, yeah Got a rich bitch, like, “You so hit” Ayy, “You so hit”", "vault_lines": ["Boy, you so hit, um, yeah"], "meaning": "Uzi is marveling at the alarming rate at which he’s made money with his talent.", "annotation_id": "8488917", "url": "https://genius.com/8488917", "state": "accepted", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "So Hit", "line": "Ksubi jeans, that with a K (A K) Banana clip in the K (The K)", "vault_lines": ["Ksubi jeans, that with a K (A K)"], "meaning": "Ksubi is an Australian fashion brand that specializes in denim. Their jeans are known to be expensive –  usually sold anywhere between $200 and $250.\n\nBanana clips are large capacity magazine clips that are curved in the same way bananas are. K is short for AK-47 – a type of automatic assault rifle that typically utilizes banana clips.", "annotation_id": "8469689", "url": "https://genius.com/8469689", "state": "accepted", "votes": 6, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "So Hit", "line": "Boy, you so hit, um, yeah Bitch, you so hit, um, yeah Fuck with them Bloods, um, yeah Fuck with them Crips, um, yeah (Yeah) Boy, you so hit, um, yeah Bitch, you so hit, um, yeah Fuck with them Bloods, um, yeah Fuck with them Crips, um, yeah (Yeah) Uzi goes in, um, yeah Uzi goes in, um, yeah She suck on my dick, um, yeah Like she a tick, um, yeah Uzi goes in, um, yeah Uzi goes in, um, yeah She suck on my dick, um, yeah Like she a tick, um, yeah", "vault_lines": ["Boy, you so sad"], "meaning": "Uzi is saying that you are lame and basic, and people can tell you’re hurt just by your appearence.\n\nHe fucks with both Bloods and Crips even tho they are rival gangs and most often can’t stand each other. Uzi’s still cool with both sides though, kinda like Chief Keef:\n\nI’m blood gang bitch I’m booling bitch I’m booling\nFuck with the crips we cooling bitch we cooling\n\nUzi’s flow is reckless as he spits “Uzi Goes In” on this bass thumping Sonny Digital Beat, as he also raps about a girl giving him fellatio or oral sex.", "annotation_id": "8423962", "url": "https://genius.com/8423962", "state": "accepted", "votes": 14, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "So Hit", "line": "Um, yeah, bitch, this Cartier Um, this not no Ray-Ban", "vault_lines": ["Um, yeah, bitch, this Cartier"], "meaning": "Uzi is presumably talking about Cartier sunglasses, which go up to, or even over $1000 per pair depending on the model. This is a more expensive alternative for Ray-Bans, which are priced at around $100-200.\n\nHe, obviously, prefers the more expensive alternative, and isn’t afraid to spend big racks on his accessories.", "annotation_id": "8402372", "url": "https://genius.com/8402372", "state": "accepted", "votes": 8, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
