{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "So High (See The Lord)*", "line": "Yeah, I feel like Stevie, can’t even see no more", "vault_lines": ["Yeah, I feel like Stevie, can't even see no more"], "meaning": "Uzi references Stevie Wonder, who is a blind singer and songwriter that was a prominent figure in music for the 20th century. His first album/project was titled The Jazz Soul of Little Stevie and was released in September 1962.\n\n\n\nUzi is a frequent referencer of Stevie Wonder, and does so again on NAV’s 2017 single “Wanted You”.\n\nStevie Wonder, I can’t see you (Can’t do this)", "annotation_id": "21685641", "url": "https://genius.com/21685641", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
