{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Smoking on Whoever", "line": "I know a Dummy who thought he was Flash, and tripped, and now that nigga got me high", "vault_lines": ["I know a Dummy who thought he was Flash, and tripped, and now that nigga got me high"], "meaning": "Refers to Dummy aka Dumout, Dougie’s deceased opp (Drilly, Bloodhound Brim Jets) who died during a altercation at a party with a Crip member.", "annotation_id": "27504609", "url": "https://genius.com/27504609", "state": "pending", "votes": -1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
