{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Slayerr", "line": "Fell addicted to codeine, put it to the side Falling down, I’m down and out", "vault_lines": ["Fell addicted to codeine, put it to the side"], "meaning": "Codeine is an opiate usually taken in the form of lean, a drink concoction usually made with codeine/promethazine cough syrup, a sweet drink, and ice. Codeine is known to induce a feeling of euphoria and lightness and is recognized as addictive and highly prone to substance abuse.", "annotation_id": "22571197", "url": "https://genius.com/22571197", "state": "accepted", "votes": 8, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Slayerr", "line": "She said this shit taste so good, but bitch you taste nut (Ew)", "vault_lines": ["She said this shit taste so good, but bitch you taste nut (Ew)"], "meaning": "Semen is said to taste different depending on the diet of the person whose semen is being tasted. It is said that sweet semen is often ejected by people with good diets consisting of vegetables. This could be a possible flex where Uzi is claiming to have the luxury of eating healthy to the point where his semen tastes good to the said bitch in the line.", "annotation_id": "17459150", "url": "https://genius.com/17459150", "state": "accepted", "votes": 12, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Slayerr", "line": "It’s a whole opposite life, I swear this shit is not weird (No)", "vault_lines": ["It's a whole opposite life, I swear this shit is not weird (No)"], "meaning": "Uzi lives such a different life people see him as weird or strange because of his style of music and fashion. He wants his listeners to know yeah it’s the opposite but it’s not weird at all. It’s awesome.", "annotation_id": "17443719", "url": "https://genius.com/17443719", "state": "accepted", "votes": 10, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Slayerr", "line": "Rockstar lifestyle, guitar got the Fenders (Yeah, uh)", "vault_lines": ["Rockstar lifestyle, guitar got the Fenders (Yeah, uh)"], "meaning": "Fender is a famous guitar brand, whose instruments have been played by some of the greatest rockstars including Jimi Hendrix, Paul McCartney and David Gilmour.", "annotation_id": "17434094", "url": "https://genius.com/17434094", "state": "accepted", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Slayerr", "line": "Heavy artillery, my waist up (Uh, pew-pew-pew), uh Got some shit that probably eat yo’ face up (Uh), uh", "vault_lines": ["Heavy artillery, my waist up (Uh, pew-pew-pew), uh"], "meaning": "The type of “heavy artillery” that Uzi references here would be guns with a lot of fire power, just like heavy artillery. As Uzi says he has heavy artillery on his waist, he’s likely to be referencing a hard-hitting handgun or a handheld submachine gun. One such gun would be an Uzi.\n\nAside from incorporating the weapon in his name, Uzi also has a chain featuring it.", "annotation_id": "17426318", "url": "https://genius.com/17426318", "state": "accepted", "votes": 8, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Slayerr", "line": "I’m in outer space, not a lander", "vault_lines": ["I'm in outer space, not a lander"], "meaning": "This line could mean 2 things, it could mean Uzi is so high that he’s in outer space, or it could be a reference to him believing he’s not from earth.", "annotation_id": "16914386", "url": "https://genius.com/16914386", "state": "accepted", "votes": 17, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Slayerr", "line": "Young Lombardo, I’m a slayer (Lil Uzi Vert, Lil Uzi Vert) Yeah (8-8-8-8) Young Lombardo, I’m a slayer (Yeah) Young Lombardo, I’m a slayer (Yeah) Young Lombardo, I’m a slayer (Yeah) Young Lombardo, I’m a slayer", "vault_lines": ["I'm a slayer (Lil Uzi Vert, Lil Uzi Vert)"], "meaning": "Uzi is talking about Dave Lombardo who was drummer and co-founder of metal band Slayer.", "annotation_id": "16896867", "url": "https://genius.com/16896867", "state": "accepted", "votes": 46, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Slayerr", "line": "Dick so long, it’s fuckin’ up her makeup (Damn), uh", "vault_lines": ["Dick so long, it's fuckin' up her makeup (Damn), uh"], "meaning": "If a girl is deep throating sometimes it can cause their eyes to water which would make their makeup specifically their eyeliner and eyeshadow ruined.", "annotation_id": "16892522", "url": "https://genius.com/16892522", "state": "accepted", "votes": 34, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Slayerr", "line": "I got on my Timbs, them bitches laced up (Up), uh", "vault_lines": ["I got on my Timbs, them bitches laced up (Up), uh"], "meaning": "Another NYC reference. It’s a common stereotype that New Yorkers wear Timberlands and wear Yankee hats. Meaning he’s most likely in NYC", "annotation_id": "16892412", "url": "https://genius.com/16892412", "state": "accepted", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Slayerr", "line": "It came with a hater, it came with a waiter (Wow), uh", "vault_lines": ["It came with a hater, it came with a waiter (Wow), uh"], "meaning": "Uzi is talking about his new crib still and saying that it is so big when he bought it that it came with people hating on him for being able to afford it.\n\nIn reference to the waiter it could either mean the house is so big he has a literal waiter to take his order for a chef or just to make him drinks. It could also just mean a butler.", "annotation_id": "16892311", "url": "https://genius.com/16892311", "state": "accepted", "votes": 6, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Slayerr", "line": "Harlem bitch, I can’t shake ya (Uh), uh", "vault_lines": ["Harlem bitch, I can't shake ya (Uh), uh"], "meaning": "Harlem is a neighbourhood in New York City meaning the girl he is talking about is from there.\n\nIt could also refer to the 2013 meme the Harlem Shake. Meaning that he can’t get rid of the girl he is talking about.\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8vJiSSAMNWw", "annotation_id": "16892260", "url": "https://genius.com/16892260", "state": "accepted", "votes": 9, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Slayerr", "line": "She give me the chance, I hit her like a Raider (Oh, yeah)", "vault_lines": ["She give me the chance, I hit her like a Raider (Oh, yeah)"], "meaning": "The Oakland Raiders is an NFL team and they have players such as Khalil Mack who is known for tackling a 315 pound player with only one hand. They also have Marshawn Lynch who can truck almost anybody. What Uzi is saying here is that if the girl he is talking about lets him smash he will pipe her hard in a way that compares to an Oakland Raider hitting another NFL player.", "annotation_id": "16892119", "url": "https://genius.com/16892119", "state": "accepted", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Slayerr", "line": "My new crib, this shit’s so big, it is amazin’ (Oh, yeah)", "vault_lines": ["My new crib, this shit's so big, it is amazin' (Oh, yeah)"], "meaning": "Since being a superstar, Uzi has earned a lot of money. The Philadelphia rapper invested in a new house, as he asserts it in “Money Keep Coming,” another Uzi song that leaked a few days prior to “Slayer:”\n\nIt’s no way you can buy hoe\nBut I bought a mansion with the sly dough\n\nUzi elaborated several times on how his new mansion keeps amazing him even months after buying it. He did so on Gunna’s 2017 “At The Hotel,” in which he raps:\n\nMy new crib so big, yeah my backyard it got a trail\n\nIn Pressa’s “420 in London,” he references his new house by rapping:\n\nMy new crib, it’s so big, this shit got a office", "annotation_id": "16890092", "url": "https://genius.com/16890092", "state": "accepted", "votes": 15, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Slayerr", "line": "Yeah, she’s in love with a rager (Yeah) She’s a rockstar, everybody said, “Don’t date her” (Come on) I’m no dummy, no, I do not have a cape, sir (Oh, yeah) I just wanted to have my way, didn’t mean to save her (No) She’s in love with a rager (Yeah) She’s a rockstar, everybody said, “Don’t date her” (Oh, yeah) I’m no dummy, no, I do not have a cape, sir (Oh, come on) I just wanted to have my way, didn’t mean to save her (No)", "vault_lines": ["She's in love with a rager (Yeah)"], "meaning": "In “Slayer,” Uzi discusses his relationship with a rockstar girl, most likely Brittany Byrd who Uzi dated on and off throughout his career.\n\n\n\nUzi refers to he and his fans as “ragers,” and two of his projects contain the title, including his first mixtape “Luv is Rage” in 2015 and first studio album “Luv is Rage 2” in 2017. Brittany is pictured on the cover of Luv is Rage and Uzi name drops her in his other mixtapes.\n\nUzi was told by many not to date this girl, as rockstars often live crazy lifestyles, but Uzi also considers himself a rockstar so he couldn’t resist.\n\n However, he did not consider the responsibilities that come with dating a rockstar, and knows he can’t be her hero which is how she sees him.", "annotation_id": "16889839", "url": "https://genius.com/16889839", "state": "accepted", "votes": 62, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
