{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Skir Skirr", "line": "Uh, mix the yellow with white gold", "vault_lines": ["Uh, mix the yellow with white gold"], "meaning": "Mixing yellow and white gold is a common jewelry fashion where you wear white gold and yellow gold at the same time which Uzi is seen to be doing occasionally\n\n\n\nA similar lyric is also seen in Lil Uzi Vert’s song “Changed My Phone”https://genius.com/Lil-uzi-vert-and-gucci-mane-changed-my-phone-lyrics", "annotation_id": "36098381", "url": "https://genius.com/36098381", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
