{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Skir Skirr", "line": "Margiela, bitch, I’m stylin’ (Uh)", "vault_lines": ["Margiela, bitch, I'm stylin' (Uh)"], "meaning": "Maison Margiela, formerly Maison Martin Margiela, is a French luxury fashion house founded by Belgian designer Martin Margiela and Jenny Meirens in 1988 and headquartered in Paris", "annotation_id": "33230215", "url": "https://genius.com/33230215", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Skir Skirr", "line": "Bitch, I’m shoppin’, Milan", "vault_lines": ["Bitch, I'm shoppin', Milan"], "meaning": "Milan is a well-known city in the North of Italy.\nPeople know it because of high-fashion.", "annotation_id": "24619560", "url": "https://genius.com/24619560", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Skir Skirr", "line": "Yeah, had no shoes we had to share a pair, ayy", "vault_lines": ["Yeah, had no shoes we had to share a pair, ayy"], "meaning": "Uzi and his friends couldn’t afford shoes so they had to share'em.\nNowadays, you know, he rich…", "annotation_id": "24619556", "url": "https://genius.com/24619556", "state": "pending", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Skir Skirr", "line": "Old school Teddy Riley", "vault_lines": ["Old school Teddy Riley"], "meaning": "Uzi name drops American singer song writer, Teddy Riley, known for his work with old school legends the likes of Michael Jackson and Usher.", "annotation_id": "13186994", "url": "https://genius.com/13186994", "state": "accepted", "votes": 7, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Skir Skirr", "line": "Got my ring like a Hobbit", "vault_lines": ["Got my ring like a Hobbit"], "meaning": "The Lord of the Rings is a movie trilogy released in 2001. Recently the novel prequel that the series is based on was also adapted and released as another movie trilogy titled The Hobbit.\n\nBoth trilogies feature a plot centered around a hobbit (a member of an imaginary race similar to humans, of small size and with hairy feet) acquiring a ring that gives the wearer various powers.", "annotation_id": "13132132", "url": "https://genius.com/13132132", "state": "accepted", "votes": 5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Skir Skirr", "line": "Oh, I— Oh, I think they— Yeah, oh, I— Oh, I think they like me (Uh, think they like) Maybe ’cause my wrist is biting (Uh) Maybe ’cause my chain get hyphy (Huh)", "vault_lines": ["Yeah, skirr, uh, skirr-skirr, uh, skirr"], "meaning": "Uzi references the 2009, hit song by Dem Franchize Boyz, “I Think They Like Me”.", "annotation_id": "13132105", "url": "https://genius.com/13132105", "state": "accepted", "votes": -11, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Skir Skirr", "line": "Ayy, wrist it be cool like a Frigidaire", "vault_lines": ["Ayy, they throwing shots, but they missin' there, ayy, wrist it be cool like a Frigidaire"], "meaning": "“Ice” or “Icy” is slang used to describe jewelry or specifically diamonds. As a result, words that pertain to the cold nature of ice are commonly used by rappers to allude to their abundance of jewelry.\n\nUzi’s simile here compares his jewelry to the home appliance brand Frigidaire, known for their refrigerators.", "annotation_id": "13131958", "url": "https://genius.com/13131958", "state": "accepted", "votes": 9, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Skir Skirr", "line": "Ayy, everyday, I had to shed a tear", "vault_lines": ["In the hood, I was just livin' there, ayy, everyday, I had to shed a tear"], "meaning": "“Dirty” is another name for lean, the popular concoction of prescription grade cough syrup and any soft drink.\nhttps://twitter.com/liluzivert/status/509846616078286848?lang=en", "annotation_id": "13095436", "url": "https://genius.com/13095436", "state": "accepted", "votes": -7, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Skir Skirr", "line": "Lil’ nigga, but I’m stocky (Ooh) Same city, yeah, as Rocky (Ayy)", "vault_lines": ["Lil' nigga, but I'm stocky (Ooh)"], "meaning": "Uzi makes reference to the iconic fictional boxer Rocky Balboa who is portrayed by Sylvester Stallone in the 6 film franchise.\n\nIn the films, Rocky is from Philadelphia, the same city as LUV.", "annotation_id": "13092689", "url": "https://genius.com/13092689", "state": "accepted", "votes": 14, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Skir Skirr", "line": "I’m a fool with the pole (Ooh) So slimy, wipe my nose (Check it)", "vault_lines": ["I'm a fool with the pole (Ooh)"], "meaning": "“Pole” is slang for a gun. In fact Uzi’s stage name hints at the fact that he’s not one to be messed with the game. In “Safe House”, he raps:\n\nMargiela with the raf shit got all this I’m laying that\nI ain’t got no real problems, if I do AK in that\n\nSlime is slang for finessing someone, and Slime or the Slimes is a gang Young Thug is a member of which was created by Ola Playa. This line could also allude to the “Snotty Nose Mafia”, a collective headed by Trippie Redd and Chris King.", "annotation_id": "13080872", "url": "https://genius.com/13080872", "state": "accepted", "votes": 8, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Skir Skirr", "line": "Ooh, heavy coke on the stove", "vault_lines": ["Ooh, heavy coke on the stove"], "meaning": "A reference to crack cocaine. When making crack, powdered cocaine is generally put in a pot, dissolved in water, heated on a stove, and then cooled to a hardened rock.", "annotation_id": "13076506", "url": "https://genius.com/13076506", "state": "accepted", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Skir Skirr", "line": "Now my neck shine like a chandelier", "vault_lines": [", now my neck shine like a chandelier"], "meaning": "Uzi makes reference to his many different diamond encrusted chains.", "annotation_id": "13074974", "url": "https://genius.com/13074974", "state": "accepted", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
