{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Show U Off", "line": "We got Glocks and choppers and lot of Rugers", "vault_lines": ["We got Glocks and choppers and lot of Rugers"], "meaning": "Glock is an Austrian gun manufacturer. “Glock” is slang for a semi-automatic pistol produced by Glock.\nHere, is a Glock 17 Gen5\n\n\n\n A “Chopper” is another term for a fully automatic rifle, often used instead of the “Thompson submachine gun” and “AK-47.” gun models.\n\nRuger or Ruger Firearms is an American gun manufacturer. Ruger has many gun models, such as the “Ruger P89.”\n\nHere, is a “Ruger P89”.\n\n\n\nUzi is saying that he and the people alongside him have lots of these types of guns.", "annotation_id": "17061081", "url": "https://genius.com/17061081", "state": "pending", "votes": 8, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
