{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Shot a Movie", "line": "(Ayy, Brandon, man, why you do that?)", "vault_lines": ["Lyrics from Snippets & Performances"], "meaning": "This is the tag for producer Brandon Finessin who is a frequent collaborator of Lil Uzi Vert and is part of the producer collective Working on Dying", "annotation_id": "20290126", "url": "https://genius.com/20290126", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Uzi Vert", "song": "Shot a Movie", "line": "Xzibit braids, woah (Woah) Faded like Boosie, uh (Ayy)", "vault_lines": ["Faded like Boosie, uh (Ayy)"], "meaning": "Xzibit is an American rapper, actor, and broadcaster. He is well known for his “Xzibit braids” Boosie Badazz or simply Boosie, is an American rapper, singer, songwriter, actor, record producer and executive. He is well known for his “Boosie Fade” haircut. These lyrics demonstrate the mix of both haircuts that Lil Uzi Vert has.", "annotation_id": "18711934", "url": "https://genius.com/18711934", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
